":"https://api.github.com/users/execbat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/execbat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/execbat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/execbat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/1dd9c1275863f6c539ffa1c63582a2e60b57d6ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:13:36Z","email":"158776588+execbat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Evgenii Dushkin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:13:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add native LeRobot Pi0.5 checkpoint serving support (#117)\n\n- add dedicated lerobot-server for LeRobot-finetuned Pi0.5 checkpoints\n- load checkpoint config, model weights, preprocessors, and postprocessors natively\n- keep the existing OpenPI Pi0.5 serving path unchanged\n- add OpenPI-compatible WebSocket transport for playground integration\n- add pi05_checkpoint KServe deployment with separate runtime, PVC, and scaler\n- add Hugging Face checkpoint download for execbat/pi05-robot-finetuned\n- add playground entry for the fine-tuned Pi0.5 checkpoint\n- handle Pi0.5 camera inputs, empty camera slot, state, prompt, and action chunks\n- add README documentation for the LeRobot server and checkpoint deployment","tree":{"sha":"536a17a1789b4beb53749d88f484cd2139f82c11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/536a17a1789b4beb53749d88f484cd2139f82c11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/1dd9c1275863f6c539ffa1c63582a2e60b57d6ee","verification":{"payload":"tree 536a17a1789b4beb53749d88f484cd2139f82c11\nparent d93880c30c74b11ec610732653e878e4b92596ea\nauthor Evgenii Dushkin <158776588+execbat@users.noreply.github.com> 1790784816 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790784816 +0100\n\nAdd native LeRobot Pi0.5 checkpoint serving support (#117)\n\n- add dedicated lerobot-server for LeRobot-finetuned Pi0.5 checkpoints\n- load checkpoint config, model weights, preprocessors, and postprocessors natively\n- keep the existing OpenPI Pi0.5 serving path unchanged\n- add OpenPI-compatible WebSocket transport for playground integration\n- add pi05_checkpoint KServe deployment with separate runtime, PVC, and scaler\n- add Hugging Face checkpoint download for execbat/pi05-robot-finetuned\n- add playground entry for the fine-tuned Pi0.5 checkpoint\n- handle Pi0.5 camera inputs, empty camera slot, state, prompt, and action chunks\n- add README documentation for the LeRobot server and checkpoint deployment","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvTUwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADu8QABJLqfVN79MuU+SXNc+jQIt6\ngMhQ0Dzhr6jgPEE9kFBv3UIYtZOI7+B1rkWOZ1OwchbX3sb9KLcuWGUP/j3/eNqC\nfa/W6m3ItXo0HNRJMT4mlchUqLBJa2ViTsNmcRByNvzTqZ8gHfWg5HKyKaFaJe2o\n4Xrao6qSbzt5kx3RwWy75bPM73nMa2qtycxaacgCLzz+J2dZN2NVJvb2s0uY+jDY\nJc/TML4sQLl3QQQ4NcmtC2usErkbcHnezAMeRIR2O0TMkOGSb9bhVlJGex/k0qUW\nUrj9HEMTShbNQGP5V/cGsHMSRHe2VKx8o/9tzfmIo+NsDLHKiSmZ6mp6QUmpCF/4\n54y68gQOeOMIBdMDXxiKA89eeRAzKC74U2RBleyBQsutAb5r1U4/GLh/IPhbHMSO\nrbtr7igrGDG03dHXPrNT9UUOIQ3QuWHCCAAGsBH3vF8wClZaUt6z09AUHIFih2rl\n72sB/nBrqKf8ewngv5s6QIPgCzFBA6Jl414dksCbelDQsKJcD/fNxR8Mlz5fUfT/\ncRKetjGgfViY9QTe6YXIXPbLtDTmJZGIy80F/3cOreTzRWAxEpxrSnAqouHV2Or5\n3wNFRcOTxXFHGEpy4RVLzGSjWG53dcTMIJxLdnX9lFickOaopkZpDcE21DgvVRtC\nWpjtrLOjmBXAxtSX8y8Y\n=4yET\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:13:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url"