{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/d93880c30c74b11ec610732653e878e4b92596ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:31:08Z","email":"fzdarsky@redhat.com","name":"Frank A. Zdarsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T21:06:00Z","email":"13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Frank Zdarsky"},"message":"fix: switch to CycloneDDS for zenoh-bridge service compatibility\n\nThe zenoh-bridge-ros2dds uses CycloneDDS internally. FastRTPS encodes\nservice request headers differently, causing all ROS 2 service calls\n(sim control) to be dropped with \"invalid request (less than 20 bytes)\".\n\nAdd RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_cyclonedds_cpp to both backend and simulator.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58ea1c44bc0499e9cd3548fd233e7e7932848de8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/58ea1c44bc0499e9cd3548fd233e7e7932848de8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/d93880c30c74b11ec610732653e878e4b92596ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsk