-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/f793af1ea04e46631957b115efeeb26d3faae2e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:00:52Z","email":"fzdarsky@redhat.com","name":"Frank A. Zdarsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:01:49Z","email":"13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Frank Zdarsky"},"message":"fix(simulator): temporarily use fzdarsky fork for simulation interfaces\n\nPoint the simulator''s clone-env init container at the fzdarsky fork of\nros2_manager_based_env (branch feat/simulation-interfaces-services) to\nenable end-to-end testing of simulation_interfaces services while\nwaiting for upstream PR redhat-et/ros2_manager_based_env#1 to merge.\n\nThis patch should be removed once that PR is merged.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdf94253c6edddcbdc2ac678785a20e22c9adb23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/cdf94253c6edddcbdc2ac678785a20e22c9adb23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/f793af1ea04e46631957b115efeeb26d3faae2e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/rep