"name":"Frank A. Zdarsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T16:51:08Z","email":"13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Frank Zdarsky"},"message":"fix(playground): increase API container memory for 1GiB Rerun buffer\n\nThe robotics-playground backend now uses a 1GiB Rerun telemetry buffer\n(up from 64MiB). Increase memory requests from 256Mi to 1536Mi and\nlimits from 2Gi to 3Gi to accommodate the buffer plus Python process,\ncamera image processing, and policy inference overhead.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c4960edf465ff3f237ef06406292f68221b5af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/8c4960edf465ff3f237ef06406292f68221b5af7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/6df309397756bff6bba40a83d9793a51004249c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commit/6df309397756bff6bba40a83d9793a51004249c2","node_id":"C_kwDOTCPMvtoAKDZkZjMwOTM5Nzc1NmJmZjZiYmE0MGE4M2Q5NzkzYTUxMDA0MjQ5YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commit/93a3396c040b7650341e633e96959db8249bd95f","sha":"93a3396c040b7650341e633e96959db8249bd95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/93a3396c040b7650341e633e96959db8249bd95f"}],"sha":"6df309397756bff6bba40a83d9793a51004249c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/6df309397756bff6bba40a83d9793a51004249c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/93a3396c040b7650341e633e96959db8249bd95f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:52:40Z","email":"fzdarsky@redhat.com","name":"Frank A. Zdarsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:55:06Z","email":"13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Frank Zdarsky"},"message":"fix(gpu): use L4 (large) instances for simulator and pi0.5\n\nSwitch simulator and pi0.5 from L40S (xlarge) to L4 (large) GPU nodes.\nBoth workloads have been tested successfully on L4 instances, which are\nmore available and cost-effective (24GB VRAM is sufficient).\n\nDreamZero stays on L40S (xlarge) — it requires 2x GPUs with 48GB VRAM\neach. Also switch its nodeSelector from the runtime label\n(nvidia.com/gpu.product) to the static MachineSet label\n(gpu-pool-size) for autoscaler compatibility.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"924c66a0520e392694a01cd694fa1ecb65b8380e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/924c66a0520e392694a01cd694fa1ecb65b8380e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/93a3396c040b7650341e633e96959db8249bd95f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commit/93a3396c040b7650341e633e96959db8249bd95f","node_id":"C_kwDOTCPMvtoAKDkzYTMzOTZjM