/api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/ef7beb7f89b8495d32e4f24aaf66a4d7768e09f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:36:05Z","email":"fzdarsky@redhat.com","name":"Frank A. Zdarsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:45:38Z","email":"13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Frank Zdarsky"},"message":"fix(simulator): update references for robotics-playground simulator rename\n\nThe robotics-playground repo renamed its simulator resources in PRs #126\nand fix/backend-zenoh-service-name:\n- Deployment: isaac-lab → simulator\n- Service: isaac-lab-zenoh → simulator-zenoh\n- ConfigMap: zenoh-isaac-lab-config → simulator-zenoh-config\n- Kustomize base path: deploy/kustomize/isaac-lab → deploy/kustomize/simulator\n- Labels: app.kubernetes.io/name: isaac-lab → simulator\n\nUpdate all references in this repo:\n- Rename platform/base/isaac-sim/ directory to platform/base/simulator/\n- Update remote Kustomize base URL to new path\n- Rename Deployment patch target, ServiceAccount, and ClusterRoleBinding\n- Update overlay kustomization.yaml references in dev-gpu and demo\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2699084042570acb655dba115e0555a20b745882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/2699084042570acb655dba115e0555a20b745882"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/ef7beb7f89b8495d32e4f24aaf66a4d7768e09f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commit/ef7beb7f89b8495d32e4f24aaf66a4d7768e09f8","node_id":"C_kwDOTCPMvtoAKGVmN2JlYjdmODliODQ5NWQzMmU0ZjI0YWFmNjZhNGQ3NzY4ZTA5Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commit/be65f5fdbd7356c894ddab79d1415193122793a3","sha":"be65f5fdbd7356c894ddab79d1415193122793a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/be65f5fdbd7356c894ddab79d1415193122793a3"}],"sha":"ef7beb7f89b8495d32e4f24aaf66a4d7768e09f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/ef7beb7f89b8495d32e4f24aaf66a4d7768e09f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/be65f5fdbd7356c894ddab79d1415193122793a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:40:01Z","email":"fzdarsky@redhat.com","name":"Frank A. Zdarsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:39:07Z","email":"13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Frank Zdarsky"},"message":"fix(isaac-lab): use static MachineSet label and add GPU toleration\n\nThe isaac-lab deployment used nvidia.com/gpu.product (a runtime label\napplied by the NVIDIA device plugin) as its nodeSelector. This prevents\nthe cluster autoscaler from matching the pod to the correct MachineSet\nsince that label isn''t in the MachineSet template.\n\nSwitch to gpu-pool-size: xlarge (the static MachineSet label for\ng6e.12xlarge / 4x L40S nodes) and add a toleration for the\nnvidia.com/gpu NoSchedule taint that the GPU Operator applies.\n\nDiscovered during robotics-playground PR #125 testing on a fresh\ncluster with no pre-existing GPU nodes.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c2370906c3de81b20ad47c14ec81c9406745765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/9c2370906c3de81b20ad47c14ec81c9406745765"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/be65f5fdbd7356c894ddab79d1415193122793a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"ava