er Route uses path-based routing under /rerun, so the\nbackend needs the full path in the URL it sends to clients.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1267170f567592f722604a21ac6e17a01440379e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/1267170f567592f722604a21ac6e17a01440379e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/d212c57ddaae3613de4cd1ac2525374cf022c3ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commit/d212c57ddaae3613de4cd1ac2525374cf022c3ef","node_id":"C_kwDOTCPMvtoAKGQyMTJjNTdkZGFhZTM2MTNkZTRjZDFhYzI1MjUzNzRjZjAyMmMzZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commit/b130d66305418829820cc478ddd921368071b919","sha":"b130d66305418829820cc478ddd921368071b919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/b130d66305418829820cc478ddd921368071b919"}],"sha":"d212c57ddaae3613de4cd1ac2525374cf022c3ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/d212c57ddaae3613de4cd1ac2525374cf022c3ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/b130d66305418829820cc478ddd921368071b919/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T13:43:32Z","email":"13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Frank Zdarsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T13:43:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(robotics-playground): move Rerun web viewer from backend to frontend (#67)\n\n* refactor(robotics-playground): move Rerun web viewer from backend to frontend\n\nThe robotics-playground frontend now serves the Rerun WASM viewer as\nstatic assets from nginx instead of the backend''s rr.serve_web_viewer().\n\n- Add /rerun/ location block to nginx config with caching headers\n- Create route for frontend''s /rerun path in redhat-ods-applications\n- Remove rerun-web port (9090) from backend deployment and service\n- Delete backend rerun-web route (no longer needed)\n- Update RERUN_VIEWER_URL to point to the new frontend route\n\nThe gRPC data stream (port 9876) remains on the backend unchanged.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(robotics-playground): address review findings on caching and yamllint\n\nUse ETag-based revalidation (no-cache) for Rerun viewer assets instead\nof immutable caching, and fix yamllint directive to disable-next-line.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9e567e2a42c427e48939003548f25f2cfdc0d1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/d9e567e2a42c427e48939003548f25f2cfdc0d1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/b130d66305418829820cc478ddd921368071b919","verification":{"payload":"tree d9e567e2a42c427e48939003548f25f2cfdc0d1e\nparent 319d43e6c775acb92249f7e4eecc1fd68edf095e\nauthor Frank Zdarsky <13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com> 1784123012 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784123012 +0200\n\nrefactor(robotics-playground): move Rerun web viewer from backend to frontend (#67)\n\n* refactor(robotics-playground): move Rerun web viewer from backend to frontend\n\nThe robotics-playground frontend now serves the Rerun WASM viewer as\nstatic assets from nginx instead of the backend''s rr.serve_web_viewer().\n\n- Add /rerun/ location block to nginx config with caching headers\n- Create route for frontend''s /rerun path in redhat-ods-applications\n- Remove rerun-web port (9090) from backend deployment and service\n- Delete backend rerun-web route (no longer needed)\n- Update RERUN_VIEWER_URL to point to the new frontend route\n\nThe gRPC data stream (port 9876) remains on the backend unchanged.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(robotics-playground): address review findings on caching and yamllint\n\nUse ETag-based revalidation (no-cache) for Rerun viewer assets instead\nof immutable caching, and fix yamllint directive to disable-next-line.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV46ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJRAQAIgTfGm8GlWOvRwH/IHy/wmn\n40PcLJqmzkygivd4pqz191Fdxu/wKfj4FlLZSniMLEXr1tesGwReDfNWxI9YgHNt\n39JAW4Hzt1K2JRlAhtup7E3++q2P3AghPL82KbHpVuBDmmiKn9XxA6HptB7aFn3d\nxeVUXa+Ctl7cBAClt9LGgRaal3cpV3wzQt28IOrgWuroo6pq1KAd4Yy4+TV0icar\nlknc7dLWr8Q/Nbz2SoggZQXAhZwiJHlC7bvzvrbJjhFkXdKY5Wk+6FNB06VZvvWK\nTUrIs1HhnsqG8K343NiUeo3t6dkKEXVD7rBRUR96nAvUCn8ApfaMsAt0vk58+FVz\nga8iJAnC1nXadZIQA+seR5t7gWUr97ZM/+sTIT0gGDWxIwVPvPPmeGY3CHbaQHmA\nmhSihXOPfYyIWGkgSzllShCqKMluKEAAVpstaoAA8Kw1aWkVNaKPI2rEGYqmSOHt\nzmZQumUAIRGfc+aUFT77ezv5m9M9IgwDrwXDhiVflzVlkVVnP89vSYRpiwwUtb3y\nK6LqsTK8M+yEakL48paKJIDI0p7rASwBdQ9BRwAJLsCEN2g00UnUwjh8OpFyuOqX\nVrUC9wHfW8IAZj6zdYzReZD65E63JEJ2wft6PhiX3vG0z/zvdgPB/g1ZXkJt07MJ\nLZ5D6VzBN/eOgbIyRCJZ\n=cKlc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T13:43:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},