node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/8f878a73e956a72377ba9a503ef79674940fe1d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T06:51:53Z","email":"13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Frank Zdarsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T06:51:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(models): add pi0.5 robot policy model to catalog (#56)\n\n* feat(models): add pi0.5 robot policy model to catalog\n\nAdd Physical Intelligence''s pi0.5 (4B VLA) served via native OpenPI\nruntime on 1x L40S GPU. Includes new openpi-runtime ServingRuntime,\nMaaS integration, KEDA scale-to-zero, and model download job from\nlerobot/pi05_base (public, no HF token needed).\n\nAlso bumps DreamZero''s vLLM-Omni image to cuda-28466746130.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(openpi-server): add Containerfile and Makefile for OpenPI server image\n\nBuild infrastructure for the OpenPI policy server container image\n(quay.io/redhat-et/openpi-server:latest), needed to serve pi0.5 via\nKServe. Clones Physical-Intelligence/openpi at build time with a\npinnable OPENPI_REF build arg. Also removes the TODO comment from the\npi05 ServingRuntime now that the build exists.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(openpi-server): use fully-qualified image name for RHEL podman\n\nRHEL''s podman enforces short-name resolution and cannot prompt in\nnon-interactive sessions. Use docker.io/nvidia/cuda instead of\nnvidia/cuda.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pi05): use Recreate deployment strategy for GPU InferenceService\n\nConsistent with the fix applied to all other GPU models in PR #61.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef53fab0a4ed5391f353e2f96da398745402bc8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/ef53fab0a4ed5391f353e2f96da398745402bc8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/8f878a73e956a72377ba9a503ef79674940fe1d3","verification":{"payload":"tree ef53fab0a4ed5391f353e2f96da398745402bc8f\nparent 08b1cd1c18d8d0af1eb0d557db8a8f9ee680cea6\nauthor Frank Zdarsky <13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com> 1784098313 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784098313 +0200\n\nfeat(models): add pi0.5 robot policy model to catalog (#56)\n\n* feat(models): add pi0.5 robot policy model to catalog\n\nAdd Physical Intelligence''s pi0.5 (4B VLA) served via native OpenPI\nruntime on 1x L40S GPU. Includes new openpi-runtime ServingRuntime,\nMaaS integration, KEDA scale-to-zero, and model download job from\nlerobot/pi05_base (public, no HF token needed).\n\nAlso bumps DreamZero''s vLLM-Omni image to cuda-28466746130.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(openpi-server): add Containerfile and Makefile for OpenPI server image\n\nBuild infrastructure for the OpenPI policy server container image\n(quay.io/redhat-et/openpi-server:latest), needed to serve pi0.5 via\nKServe. Clones Physical-Intelligence/openpi at build time with a\npinnable OPENPI_REF build arg. Also removes the TODO comment from the\npi05 ServingRuntime now that the build exists.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(openpi-server): use fully-qualified image name for RHEL podman\n\nRHEL''s podman enforces short-name resolution and cannot prompt in\nnon-interactive sessions. Use docker.io/nvidia/cuda instead of\nnvidia/cuda.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pi05): use Recreate deployment strategy for GPU InferenceService\n\nConsistent with the fix applied to all other GPU models in PR #61.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVy4JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8jIQAFKiNui6QCnI7erlAnIP0Ua/\noPKCuhJhD1w788q2IC0zwKy2djaVGPM1xKT3Zy/f5AFfqcohmULWek81B2UsEGvz\njUQntmJrYUgR2l7fCM8UCzYfYGeiT55N9ufy6HcgZCUuL/Y4KQ7jSHmu49eBcHWh\nyzZ+6QjuHaFozstSpNQd/I0sE8q86EcBlXaRnEgRIL/HfrU5WLMGn80aAwMQOVw7\n9es+yz6ye6c+Q3GhqFtoGyhcBjEjWCC68d0QabJ6KS+51P1ceXpNyHcosRUHal0Z\nTJjGqPduZvaWRy6j3+DGlNV/CNmtoaP93KkOQNm5qEJkN1elBF82DPzGZvMO9xes\ns0BrHQMe0V9quYw/EUn6tncPevVfjCyLKyEWVIMCi+s9m8wJUPkNFzJFGkBEb9nR\nKgKT+xB1JZaaE8emH7DtH59LXGsw84LOeB5Jj7nSaqZvLNQy6nrCUTg9a5RZKSdp\nX/GIGUc0FYEZ1dun8rISrgUUnbZCJ3n4rjqZTrfZ0o/rvXNQvU3zeksngxSuf6d9\n7BIVuGDTuGAdlWTzFMLa2CHyY0gSBPZpWqVZglP0sptfphEB4865zEN+9e70QCqX\n7PVXHimxhH5xI4voue7zDfrttOEU3dKsP/yimTLxYuDOFRcAfHMCZ+d/I5dsBqIE\nt7yb2X39T4dY2juDDt0F\n=tcnL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T06:51:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscripti