//api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commits/e9c4e25dbd5740f7a4b793d147829986fd01be46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T13:59:22Z","email":"fzdarsky@redhat.com","name":"Frank A. Zdarsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:37:04Z","email":"13062727+fzdarsky@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Frank Zdarsky"},"message":"fix(feature-store): enable registry REST API and UI label\n\nThe RHOAI Dashboard discovers feature stores by:\n1. Finding namespaces with opendatahub.io/feast=true\n2. Listing FeatureStore CRs with feature-store-ui=enabled label\n3. Querying the Feast registry REST API for projects\n\nAdd the required label and enable the registry REST server so the\nDashboard can discover and display the feature store.\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f907a016bd8c1950801980edb12b09b072279c98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/f907a016bd8c1950801980edb12b09b072279c98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/e9c4e25dbd5740f7a4b793d147829986fd01be46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravat