message":"feat(fastdds-discovery): deploy FastDDS Discovery Server for ROS2 inter-pod communication\n\nKubernetes doesn''t support UDP multicast, which DDS uses for automatic\nnode discovery. Deploy a FastDDS Discovery Server as a centralized\nunicast broker so the robotics-playground backend and isaac-lab pods\ncan discover each other''s ROS2 topics.\n\n- Add fastdds-discovery Deployment (eprosima/discovery-server:v2)\n  and ClusterIP Service on UDP port 11811\n- Set ROS_DISCOVERY_SERVER env var on both robotics-playground\n  and isaac-lab deployments\n- Include fastdds-discovery in dev-gpu and demo overlays\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b11cbc54d9f78c9d466f538294edf5e28457f89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/2b11cbc54d9f78c9d466f538294edf5e28457f89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/200939892a8796626ebffb79cc53be8d447aeeef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","u