xes overscan crash)\n- FRANKA_PANDA_HIGH_PD_CFG with per-step joint hold (prevents droop)\n- Table with collision properties and colored cubes on scene\n- Updated exterior camera positions\n- Add PYTHONPATH env var for rclpy imports\n\nAssisted-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3646086ee4052e1024b1f9ae0a160b0da3b4c3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/trees/c3646086ee4052e1024b1f9ae0a160b0da3b4c3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/git/commits/b6a7227b506a63534e3b0161846af2809e9058d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13062727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fzdarsky","id":13062727,"login":"fzdarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDYyNzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fzdarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commit/b6a7227b506a63534e3b0161846af2809e9058d7","node_id":"C_kwDOTCPMvtoAKGI2YTcyMjdiNTA2YTYzNTM0ZTNiMDE2MTg0NmFmMjgwOWU5MDU4ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-et/physical-ai-platform-demo/commit/8fd889f1d8b46dbabcbfb0c66334f622c3855079","sha":"8fd889f1d8b46dbabcbfb0c663