sar esta oculto en ese\ntamano. Se le pone ademas un tope de 85vw para que en pantallas muy\nangostas quede siempre un borde visible con el que cerrarlo.\n\nVerificado en un viewport de 375x812 con la interfaz corriendo: el panel\nmide 248 pixeles, su contenido necesita exactamente 248, el desborde\nhorizontal es cero, el rotulo se lee \"SCIPOS\" completo y ninguno de los\ndiez modulos queda cortado. En escritorio el colapso sigue alternando\nentre ochenta y doscientos cuarenta y ocho.","tree":{"sha":"2f2bc8354e68a782c196f021b6d8e88268bc8060","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/trees/2f2bc8354e68a782c196f021b6d8e88268bc8060"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/commits/9ac65214fa7568c11247b4b944e1fd723ea3001a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168682233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeobardoVillalobos88","id":168682233,"login":"LeobardoVillalobos88","node_id":"U_kgDOCg3i-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88"