hore: publica la version 3.0.0 y quita el andamiaje\n\nLos diecinueve paquetes del monorepo pasan a 3.0.0, y con ellos los tags\nde imagen del compose de produccion.\n\nSe eliminan DESIGN.md, PRODUCT.md y la configuracion de .impeccable, que\nson andamiaje de una herramienta de diseno y no entregable del proyecto,\njunto con su entrada en biome.json. Los dos bloques de overrides quedan\nintactos, incluido el que mantiene compatible el codigo de la skill con\nel editor de la consola de Alexa.\n\nLas carpetas vacias de andamiaje ya no aparecen aqui: se eliminaron en\ndevelop, y su justificacion quedo documentada en\ndocs/01-architecture/estructura-del-repositorio.md.","tree":{"sha":"f0a117b186d4eef14d592f1b7b66acc3a53a7bdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/trees/f0a117b186d4eef14d592f1b7b66acc3a53a7bdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/commits/cd9319c300900556a4302e34b5405ebf178a3e21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168682233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeobardoVillalobos88","id":168682233,"login":"LeobardoVillalobos88","node_id":"U_kgDOCg3i-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos8