illalobos88","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/commits/e5b2100f87d859c180d157fcbda034216fe4b2e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:38:25Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:38:25Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"message":"style: elimina los comentarios del codigo fuente\n\nLimpieza de la version publicable. Se quitan 666 comentarios en 142\narchivos de TypeScript, JavaScript y esquemas de Prisma.\n\nSe conservan 28 comentarios que no son documentacion sino instrucciones\na una herramienta: cuatro biome-ignore, seis anotaciones de tipo de los\nnext.config y dieciocho directivas triple barra de los next-env.\n\nVerificado que la limpieza no rompe la compatibilidad de la skill con el\neditor de la consola de Alexa: los dos archivos que se pegan ahi,\nindex.js y calculos-almacen.js, siguen sin encadenamiento opcional ni\nprefijo node:.\n\nLas URLs del codigo quedan intactas; las que desaparecieron estaban\ndentro de comentarios.","tree":{"sha":"a0d65fcf1bc9d7269ca0f72d9eeb0f6b3301f69d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/trees/a0d65fcf1bc9d7269ca0f72d9eeb0f6b3301f69d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/commits/e5b2100f87d859c180d157fcbda034216fe4b2e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168682233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leobar