llalobos88","id":168682233,"login":"LeobardoVillalobos88","node_id":"U_kgDOCg3i-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/commits/29d7e7138e8334f0ddb731572035680226e43cd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:09:22Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:09:22Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"message":"chore: publica la version 2.1.0 y quita el andamiaje\n\nLos diecinueve paquetes del monorepo pasan a 2.1.0, y con ellos los tags\nde imagen del compose de produccion.\n\nSe eliminan de la version publicable los archivos que son andamiaje de\nherramientas y no entregable del proyecto: DESIGN.md, PRODUCT.md y la\nconfiguracion de .impeccable, junto con su entrada en biome.json. Los dos\nbloques de overrides quedan intactos, incluido el que desactiva cuatro\nreglas para el lambda de Alexa: sin el, el formateador reescribiria ese\ncodigo con sintaxis que el runtime de la consola no interpreta.\n\nTambien se van los marcadores de apps/mobile, que sigue fuera de alcance.","tree":{"sha":"6a41617b23e91e08694f4a0cb5d3e3e7740cdd14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/trees/6a41617b23e91e08694f4a0cb5d3e3e7740cdd14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/commits