6:26:06Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T06:26:06Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"message":"chore: publica la version 1.1.0 y quita el andamiaje\n\nLos diecisiete paquetes del monorepo pasan a 1.1.0, y con ellos los tags\nde imagen del compose de produccion, que estaban fijos en 1.0.0.\n\nSe eliminan de la version publicable los archivos que son andamiaje de\nherramientas y no entregable del proyecto: DESIGN.md, PRODUCT.md y la\nconfiguracion de .impeccable, junto con su entrada en biome.json para\nque no quede una referencia colgando. Tambien se van los marcadores de\napps/mobile, porque la aplicacion movil esta fuera de alcance.\n\nSe conservan los marcadores de packages, stubs, agents y apps/e2e:\ndocumentan la estructura objetivo descrita en CLAUDE.md.","tree":{"sha":"394ec6eeb65af8eb9ee943419b61789d6e645fb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/trees/394ec6eeb65af8eb9ee943419b61789d6e645fb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/commits/103b55d4be4bdb075cbcf294b5a7b8afadda199f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168682233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeobardoVillalobos88","id":168682233,"login":"LeobardoVillalobos88","node_id":"U_kgDOCg3i-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://