api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/commits/3544732d3fd2f8e8ded6fb8e86f74e0c77cf5c50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T06:23:59Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T06:23:59Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"message":"style: elimina los comentarios del codigo fuente\n\nLimpieza de la version publicable. Se quitan 537 comentarios en 134\narchivos de TypeScript, JavaScript y esquemas de Prisma.\n\nSe conservan 26 comentarios que no son documentacion sino instrucciones\na una herramienta: dos biome-ignore, seis anotaciones de tipo de los\nnext.config y dieciocho directivas triple barra de los next-env, que\nresuelven los tipos de Next en los microfrontends.\n\nLos .env.example quedan fuera del borrado a proposito: sus comentarios\nson las instrucciones de que credencial va en cada variable.\n\nVerificado: las 48 URLs del codigo quedan intactas y las 9 que\ndesaparecieron estaban dentro de comentarios.","tree":{"sha":"59efb96f2bb5a593e21486a8b2622b3e5c36e202","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/trees/59efb96f2bb5a593e21486a8b2622b3e5c36e202"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/commits/3544732d3fd2f8e8ded6fb8e86f74e0c77cf5c50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168682233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.