arred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/commits/0fea6b47d28290f55630d8687e661d40eb4e3cf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T04:01:12Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T04:01:12Z","email":"20233tn098@utez.edu.mx","name":"LeobardoVillalobos88"},"message":"fix: parametriza la configuracion que impedia desplegar\n\nLos origenes CORS estaban fijos a los puertos de localhost, la llave de\nfirma solo se podia leer de una ruta relativa y el web-shell forzaba el\npuerto 3001. Fuera de la maquina de desarrollo, cada uno de esos tres\npuntos rompia el arranque.\n\n- El gateway lee ORIGENES_PERMITIDOS y conserva localhost como respaldo.\n- El firmador acepta el PEM por variable de entorno, en texto o base64,\n  con prioridad sobre la ruta al archivo.\n- El web-shell respeta PORT.\n- Las contrasenas semilla se pueden sobreescribir por entorno.","tree":{"sha":"8aabe410d76870d64bb1d1ddf81e0f7937b0a8ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/trees/8aabe410d76870d64bb1d1ddf81e0f7937b0a8ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeobardoVillalobos88/Sistema-Comercial-Integral-SCIPOS/git/commits/0fea6b47d28290f55630d8687e661d40eb4e3cf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168682233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeobardoVillalobos88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.