d popover functionalities to streamline UI interactions.\n\n* feat: integrate store and supplier mappings in DVDMS configuration\n\n* feat: update DVDMS configuration to support quantity updates after receipt and refactor supplier mapping structure\n\n* refactor: remove unused supplier mapping deletion logic and clean up related code\n\n* refactor: streamline store and supplier mapping logic in DvdmsConfigurePage\n\n* feat: enhance error handling and state management for store and supplier mappings in DvdmsConfigurePage\n\n* feat: add update functionality for store and supplier mappings in DVDMS configuration\n\n* feat: improve error handling and update logic in DvdmsConfigurePage and LocationPicker components","tree":{"sha":"a0ce929e5a72bf0666310770031e7482c804a30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/care-ecosystem/care_dvdms_fe/git/trees/a0ce929e5a72bf0666310770031e7482c804a30e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/care-ecosystem/care_dvdms_fe/git/commits/b3c9b28f6518714f51cb0bde60645b2dc68cb2a3","verification":{"payload":"tree a0ce929e5a72bf0666310770031e7482c804a30e\nparent e36af37f4e481a9a1f66c61d3a60af3bc02a2c1d\nauthor Pranav Rustagi <pranav.rutagi@egovernments.org> 1786971305 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786971305 +0530\n\nConfigurations Panel: UI modifications + API integrations (#20)\n\n* Add eAushadhi institute configuration and API integration\n\n* Enhance error handling in API requests and update DvdmsConfigurePage to conditionally render based on institute presence\n\n* feat: add location and store pickers, enhance DVDMS configuration\n\n- Introduced `LocationPicker` and `EaushadhiStorePicker` components for improved user experience in selecting locations and stores.\n- Updated `DvdmsConfigurePage` to integrate the new pickers, allowing users to select locations and stores more intuitively.\n- Enhanced localization support by adding new keys in `en.json` for store and location selection.\n- Updated API calls to fetch store and location data dynamically based on user selections.\n- Refactored `DvdmsSupplierMapping` to include new fields for store and warehouse information.\n- Added utility components for command and popover functionalities to streamline UI interactions.\n\n* feat: integrate store and supplier mappings in DVDMS configuration\n\n* feat: update DVDMS configuration to support quantity updates after receipt and refactor supplier mapping structure\n\n* refactor: remove unused supplier mapping deletion logic and clean up related code\n\n* refactor: streamline store and supplier mapping logic in DvdmsConfigurePage\n\n* feat: enhance error handling and state management for store and supplier mappings in DvdmsConfigurePage\n\n* feat: add update functionality for store and supplier mappings in DVDMS configuration\n\n* feat: improve error handling and update logic in DvdmsConfigurePage and LocationPicker components","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgwSpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxH0QABO1+qpAerNMgo1Y+4BhNXR3\nVSzfGUtuhPJsTFmMqui2Jo1EkYq9QTycjc8o1Phf+DecApMWWQO3JtoE+Hvv82eb\nvkMaSd6XKxaH2FtJr9TAb1ozFtyQRmeJatEZbg9WtBys0IIUwWX0LQU6Hh+XuS9+\njR1bFlT0uzo6FUasOPv+cQzkVcVk3YLdGs6Hh3aKb7ehfgsQwdqZ5Nt2o5rojt5x\n1WHACtvWX4TMFsrnDHXKLXhGu1DzDYZryKHecnLRWUCAvPn8mcA8GGnLzCgv/Em2\nAD+MOOBPbLgbhb54wPEuszqyC3e9SouXUXrQOgjv0lk2ujoYPoX4DsodvV/76djR\nEun+rpTShBBm2RCVF7CBrKfG9rV4lN2G1jowWP/w0nWY7dOcNC04FsDP1V27G/wm\njphQ4z34cxO6cCGZ6Br0/rKJ6QIZvRoRHXDnLrXcos+TIgf0IPomm2j19K4YlLEy\naD6h6ijVYzWccxqfloKrRHotGR7vczxPpHFLu85CijJZXhMxIaALpt+TN6xtHd/M\n8J3wR6FFRXccUrYHAYBx0NxXOQPMiQaJBnCxELqTHFIvC5iDjP1RtdEIyA5NBr6z\nbDrs8ci+YBuxWQaAkFdqo/010t1F5JeXmZE2x0POuGkgVO3dr5bdR+Fq66RDXopV\nR9qQ7hloFmStW9/Pmy/m\n=FUs+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-17T12:55:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/u