ov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavrutagi-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavrutagi-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/care-ecosystem/care_dvdms_fe/commits/b0b5f41d08e71ed97505efbfaf8f9c45e6b0169d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T05:54:55Z","email":"pranav.rutagi@egovernments.org","name":"Pranav Rustagi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T05:54:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"DVDMS configuration panel UI (#13)\n\n* Update dependencies and refactor manifest and routes\n\n- Added new Radix UI components to package.json and package-lock.json.\n- Refactored manifest.tsx to remove unnecessary Suspense wrapper.\n- Cleared out routes.tsx to match the current plugin structure.\n\n* Add UI components: Button, Form, Input, Label, Sheet, and Switch\n\n* Add FacilityHomeActions component and update localization for DVDMS configuration\n\n* Refactor supplier management in FacilityHomeActions component and update localization\n\n* Add Radix UI Switch component and enhance FacilityHomeActions with supplier code validation and improved localization\n\n* Update localization strings and enhance SheetContent component with customizable close label\n\n* feat: add supplier selection and configuration to FacilityHomeActions\n\n- Added new supplier selection functionality using @radix-ui/react-select.\n- Updated the FacilityHomeActions component to manage suppliers with a new form structure.\n- Integrated API call to fetch organizations for supplier selection.\n- Enhanced localization strings for supplier management.\n- Updated DvdmsSupplierMapping interface to include supplier_id and is_default fields.\n- Created a new Organization type for better type management.\n- Adjusted Tailwind CSS configuration to scope styles within care-dvdms-container.\n\n* refactor: restructure Tailwind CSS imports and remove preflight configuration\n\n* fix: set default supplier to true and adjust initial open state in FacilityHomeActions\n\n* fix: set initial open state to false in FacilityHomeActions and remove redundant return statement","tree":{"sha":"0e3249349b59c84920827960dc3a483cc4aeb0a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/care-ecosystem/care_dvdms_fe/git/trees/0e3249349b59c84920827960dc3a483cc4aeb0a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/care-ecosystem/care_dvdms_fe/git/commits/b0b5f41d08e71ed97505efbfaf8f9c45e6b0169d","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e3249349b59c84920827960dc3a483cc4aeb0a9\nparent 23e79e995e029ab72a68e79998df9d435bfd381f\nauthor Pranav Rustagi <pranav.rutagi@egovernments.org> 1786600495 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786600495 +0530\n\nDVDMS configuration panel UI (#13)\n\n* Update dependencies and refactor manifest and routes\n\n- Added new Radix UI components to package.json and package-lock.json.\n- Refactored manifest.tsx to remove unnecessary Suspense wrapper.\n- Cleared out routes.tsx to match the current plugin structure.\n\n* Add UI components: Button, Form, Input, Label, Sheet, and Switch\n\n* Add FacilityHomeActions component and update localization for DVDMS configuration\n\n* Refactor supplier management in FacilityHomeActions component and update localization\n\n* Add Radix UI Switch component and enhance FacilityHomeActions with supplier code validation and improved localization\n\n* Update localization strings and enhance SheetContent component with customizable close label\n\n* feat: add supplier selection and configuration to FacilityHomeActions\n\n- Added new supplier selection functionality using @radix-ui/react-select.\n- Updated the FacilityHomeActions component to manage suppliers with a new form structure.\n- Integrated API call to fetch organizations for supplier selection.\n- Enhanced localization strings for supplier management.\n- Updated DvdmsSupplierMapping interface to include supplier_id and is_default fie