:"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yourssu/inhouse-client/commit/81117c26401dbeeb3a3c9f20300aa652587f8db9","node_id":"C_kwDOTC9wxtoAKDgxMTE3YzI2NDAxZGJlZWIzYTNjOWYyMDMwMGFhNjUyNTg3ZjhkYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yourssu/inhouse-client/commit/839f1a7fc3cfaa70d12b622f04b9d9ed973c82ee","sha":"839f1a7fc3cfaa70d12b622f04b9d9ed973c82ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/839f1a7fc3cfaa70d12b622f04b9d9ed973c82ee"}],"sha":"81117c26401dbeeb3a3c9f20300aa652587f8db9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/81117c26401dbeeb3a3c9f20300aa652587f8db9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84189784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jm8468","id":84189784,"login":"jm8468","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTg5Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/839f1a7fc3cfaa70d12b622f04b9d9ed973c82ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T08:52:28Z","email":"84189784+jm8468@users.noreply.github.com","name":"임서준"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T08:52:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[SCO-372] fix(scouter): 코멘트가 Card를 벗어나는 문제 수정 (#202)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n이미지처럼 뷰포트 너비가 좁아질 때 코멘트가 card 영역을 벗어나는 문제가 있었어요.\n\n### 고민한 방법들\n#### 노션처럼 뷰포트가 좁아지면 코멘트 영역을 버튼으로 숨기기\n\n[슬랙](https://yourssu.slack.com/archives/C082XCSQK0F/p1788329552996599?thread_ts=1788327815.247329&cid=C082XCSQK0F)에서\n코멘트는 항상 보였으면 좋겠다는 니즈가 있어서 적용하지 않았어요\n\n#### subgrid를 이용해 너비를 반응형으로 조절하기\n페이지에서 `지원자 응답`, `코멘트`, `평가 패널`의 비율을 grid로 한번에 정의하고 DocumentReview에서\nsubgrid로 그 비율을 따르는 방식이에요.\nDocumentReview 컴포넌트가 페이지에 종속돼서 독립성이 떨어지는 문제가 있었어요\n\n=> grid 개념만 가져가서 \n페이지에서는 `지원자 응답 + 코멘트`/ `평가 패널` 2개의 비중만 다루고,\nDocumentReview에서는 `지원자 응답` / `코멘트`를 다루도록 했어요.\n\n\n## to-be\n\n<img width=\"1673\" height=\"1042\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d41a49b-e208-45cc-8bf7-e2e41c68f8af\"\n/>\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n<!-- 링크 -->\n\n## Slack\n\n<!-- 링크 -->","tree":{"sha":"837d899d0659a6e8e27dc52448530da2e4c1a662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/trees/837d899d0659a6e8e27dc52448530da2e4c1a662"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/commits/839f1a7fc3cfaa70d12b622f04b9d9ed973c82ee","verification":{"payload":"tree 837d899d0659a6e8e27dc52448530da2e4c1a662\nparent 68c84b7efb6455fcffde2a265e4a7a1724c5857a\nauthor 임서준 <84189784+jm8468@users.noreply.github.com> 1788339148 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788339148 +0900\n\n[SCO-372] fix(scouter): 코멘트가 Card를 벗어나는 문제 수정 (#202)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n이미지처럼 뷰포트 너비가 좁아질 때 코멘트가 card 영역을 벗어나는 문제가 있었어요.\n\n### 고민한 방법들\n#### 노션처럼 뷰포트가 좁아지면 코멘트 영역을 버튼으로 숨기기\n\n[슬랙](https://yourssu.slack.com/archives/C082XCSQK0F/p1788329552996599?thread_ts=1788327815.247329&cid=C082XCSQK0F)에서\n코멘트는 항상 보였으면 좋겠다는 니즈가 있어서 적용하지 않았어요\n\n#### subgrid를 이용해 너비를 반응형으로 조절하기\n페이지에서 `지원자 응답`, `코멘트`, `평가 패널`의 비율을 grid로 한번에 정의하고 DocumentReview에서\nsubgrid로 그 비율을 따르는 방식이에요.\nDocumentReview 컴포넌트가 페이지에 종속돼서 독립성이 떨어지는 문제가 있었어요\n\n=> grid 개념만 가져가서 \n페이지에서는 `지원자 응답 + 코멘트`/ `평가 패널` 2개의 비중만 다루고,\nDocumentReview에서는 `지원자 응답` / `코멘트`를 다루도록 했어요.\n\n\n## to-be\n\n<img width=\"1673\" height=\"1042\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d41a49b-e208-45cc-8bf7-e2e41c68f8af\"\n/>\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n<!-- 링크 -->\n\n## Slack\n\n<!-- 링크 -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql+PMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS1wQAHen4sgGfnORN/RfIBVkT7ml\nAW/JL+YTtWAcudxK/6tqgVrxBL02b5URIIvacRJPHNS2hclnM597sUjD7HQpaYXP\nCINfwRv9Sei0USThvxU/tmskGFN5AzpxjAEu0zRHVTFpNmheUiZN0IMMQ4gMxAuO\n8RhMXq1p6LHNxmTwujnVXeLG1BR09VKNqJJYWlFgNMJDQ6cbKFItcq/+HW6aDAlr\nuHy3UR1Qpxk4c7WFgt5FKPQM8Zoozigx0RWdu3fCaXIqbtuPIiPskx9Pzjs9HTer\nyAla9ZVEaNeWpzLj/RjYylG0SIiY8XO21sAMIwV1P07xBWu5rVFLfGr4a41gTuZ/\nM4VWlIOG8VZX/UJtqz4XO2DclC+HvcMB9gkOLwPcUsYds6z7LrPuT68DESeyh5GN\nSVllPPvx/UggKjXM4rNTMBAVfMPht4mypj+GI9iW9WhxKH8Cm4aF1XddpvNdfauA\n0RRAtXNcZx42xu/gVqLVfspx5WQilD5dXfCf9/0qr+LlftgbEpAK7IlIVuGoejnq\nFBqk8Y37KALTDuhltSDXwAkw+mviVMvoM6J69zOJTTBlVSs17LeaYSQHMYh361l2\nmn1MYBLb27uAD3+hMbyVSEeJRtWunZ6TJUF78nKGTvtUWzP8EDjJjkJ+s4KWJfGw\nc0uxmpoH3vqebHvqg8Q4\n=j3nt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T08:52:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4