로로 이동할 때는 페이지뷰를 기록하지 않습니다.\n\n검증:\n\n- `pnpm check:type`\n- `pnpm check:lint`\n- 변경 파일 `prettier --check`\n- `@yourssu-inhouse/mfa-core`, `@yourssu-inhouse/exterior`,\n`@yourssu-inhouse/scouter`, `@yourssu-inhouse/shell` build\n\n루트 `pnpm check:format`은 이번 변경과 무관한 기존 `packages/mfa-core/src/shared.ts`\n포맷 오류로 실패합니다.\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjvwKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcCEQAHFUV67qBlY66zC890l+iiwn\nQ9eWvlMbXDelVm+UmznaNN6DIslaVe6NszdNSc3jpSNzYq7ZIksoiHuVkvTRHQ0W\nkv+3WkfYBjlJ2d4I1WX8fxSd8PjaI/rvycK0Un2EaeklNDAih23E5SKtRS8ryaWn\n7CVYHGr5YsusHwfH2mi6InLwDN8IY8H7aFT0OaOV+nuAnZwuy3AxydECu/7K2au3\nKSzpK7kG4uyObdMLXKnh673ef/jU3pNELpCndQDTAyljtOG1p5waCUDS0JG4Xqiy\nHpJ6BaY1q4VRyeEoyciJmBfx4Nz0vfE1NWG+dN2/NJguF9fGBqMv6nV77qVwvLyh\n/MgrZcaU9+xsSV7es57xzAOujyCbi+1AeLRaWtmX//besWBCaaAbe28uYLcT8lW0\nm4PWWMEA8QqWR0Cnt7xm+XZJTxW2dF7SH2Gzlkb1oIsb6m1zEAU6Rwu7FJRSo5Jy\nyZSjZJLsaGl1kG3iQO35tMzdNO8YIYjz9njMXeGMMsAbAqtDsRwYhKiKBwuOFxxO\nBlell8RsYYULBkOVt7/B0P33XPhC48E4IQGvMOQ38HezL3fpYFevwYWWlptYzRMc\n4pTcJvd4lTdRB+MEqc3qefwxB9B5ois5VJ/eucXQY52bjXbGf8bAo+9036LtYDuT\nOYSD7mtwrlmsSPfgIOt9\n=iqgp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T14:45:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_ur