448532d52421387c0384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/d4cef0e99d99a133a343448532d52421387c0384"}],"sha":"305b4e9d56ae598b1195b05a68a8c7e5564d6152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/305b4e9d56ae598b1195b05a68a8c7e5564d6152"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101973955?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fecapark","id":101973955,"login":"fecapark","node_id":"U_kgDOBhP_ww","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fecapark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/d4cef0e99d99a133a343448532d52421387c0384/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:01:14Z","email":"fecapark@gmail.com","name":"Sanghyeok Park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:01:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: 프로덕션 배포 워크플로 작성 (#178)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n기존 `deploy-pages.yml`은 main push 시 dev 자동 배포, `workflow_dispatch` env\n선택으로 dev/prod 수동 배포를 한 워크플로에서 함께 처리했다. prod 를 별도 수동 액션(GitHub UI 브랜치 선택\n→ 해당 브랜치 기준 전체 배포)으로 분리하고, 빌드된 번들이 dev/prod API 엔드포인트를 선택하도록 만들었다.\n\n## to-be\n\n- 워크플로 분리\n- `deploy-pages.yml` → `deploy-pages-dev.yml`: main push 자동 dev 배포 + 수동\n리런. diff 기반 변경 앱만 배포는 유지.\n- `deploy-pages-prod.yml` 신규: `workflow_dispatch` 전용. GitHub Actions UI\n에서 브랜치를 고르면 그 브랜치 기준으로 shell·scouter·member 3개 전체 앱을 prod CF\nPages(`inhouse-client` / `inhouse-scouter-client` /\n`inhouse-member-client`)에 배포. MSW 미주입.\n- `VITE_STAGE` 빌드 타임 주입\n- `apps/{shell,scouter,member}/src/config.ts`: `STAGE` 를 하드코딩 `''dev''` →\n`import.meta.env.VITE_STAGE` 기반으로 변경. 미지정(로컬 `pnpm dev`) 시 `dev`.\n  - `apps/*/src/vite-env.d.ts`: `VITE_STAGE` 타입 선언 추가.\n- `scripts/deploy-targets.ts`: 모든 타겟의 `envFile` 에 `VITE_STAGE=<env>` 주입.\n워크플로 env 파일 쓰기 단계를 shell 전용 → 모든 앱으로 확장.\n- 결과: prod 빌드가 `scouter-api.yourssu.com` prod API 를 호출. (이전엔 prod 배포여도\n번들이 dev API 호출)\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d44a471f11844cfe52f1c7d576c217e999b95c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/trees/d44a471f11844cfe52f1c7d576c217e999b95c27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/commits/d4cef0e99d99a133a343448532d52421387c0384","verification":{"payload":"tree d44a471f11844cfe52f1c7d576c217e999b95c27\nparent 49ddb54f712c20fd2ad2076e2da56a4dbe57ab7c\nauthor Sanghyeok Park <fecapark@gmail.com> 1787745674 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787745674 +0900\n\nchore: 프로덕션 배포 워크플로 작성 (#178)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n기존 `deploy-pages.yml`은 main push 시 dev 자동 배포, `workflow_dispatch` env\n선택으로 dev/prod 수동 배포를 한 워크플로에서 함께 처리했다. prod 를 별도 수동 액션(GitHub UI 브랜치 선택\n→ 해당 브랜치 기준 전체 배포)으로 분리하고, 빌드된 번들이 dev/prod API 엔드포인트를 선택하도록 만들었다.\n\n## to-be\n\n- 워크플로 분리\n- `deploy-pages.yml` → `deploy-pages-dev.yml`: main push 자동 dev 배포 + 수동\n리런. diff 기반 변경 앱만 배포는 유지.\n- `deploy-pages-prod.yml` 신규: `workflow_dispatch` 전용. GitHub Actions UI\n에서 브랜치를 고르면 그 브랜치 기준으로 shell·scouter·member 3개 전체 앱을 prod CF\nPages(`inhouse-client` / `inhouse-scouter-client` /\n`inhouse-member-client`)에 배포. MSW 미주입.\n- `VITE_STAGE` 빌드 타임 주입\n- `apps/{shell,scouter,member}/src/config.ts`: `STAGE` 를 하드코딩 `''dev''` →\n`import.meta.env.VITE_STAGE` 기반으로 변경. 미지정(로컬 `pnpm dev`) 시 `dev`.\n  - `apps/*/src/vite-env.d.ts`: `VITE_STAGE` 타입 선언 추가.\n- `scripts/deploy-targets.ts`: 모든 타겟의 `envFile` 에 `VITE_STAGE=<env>` 주입.\n워크플로 env 파일 쓰기 단계를 shell 전용 → 모든 앱으로 확장.\n- 결과: prod 빌드가 `scouter-api.yourssu.com` prod API 를 호출. (이전엔 prod 배포여도\n번들이 dev API 호출)\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjtWKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7fQQACCnSNbCqbu249LmYY+nSHov\nOoMkzpiZAxF8HSJ5vWt0rsyHu7lbajh473PO+8oQlpJvnOn2MCBxLqkcBx6XzQfb\nBwX/d9xnw9n9yoUIa3ZbZjoyCTDnJaBkPLfYsM+t/Wc2+RKe+3Suh8UkUHtxbhvE\nZ48q+IMpCX880nL9oGLipdm5EBxKAP3Qy27qVv5FcsYs2onXSg4+YzyeUqgUo6GU\noX1554y7Rs0RR8rfVX7G/SkkKfwPhm3ebDqcTQuKGfLyqBqxZF8y6Sc0LLF3+UoX\nhrjafosZlEnyocFe8x6L2XB7j9dmFzQDvhjA7dl08aFb6moCu2RSOaWPL0yB3MHD\nBGXAxtEIJR3QiZO8q97IA6ZyAlbeRih0f6i6J7Uwin3TqZiBGnShCJWH3syugJ7E\niMU6yWxYCquSVmUPtTYvJs5EdOeuwZSuKkDiMqu/ubdBbDcWTa/ICen+7RADVNV+\nBPT3lvj4+F5O//uwGTroFfb+RMlO2JFvlbwve9k10SPPhjqc3osTiRg0XkHJtQkA\nL2x1wYPkznpU21SlwSThlu7wspghtUvCRREBxiRcZj0s9ZAFiX8biwTF8sEGzVac\nykSjPQApvb6tvqlitzs8kkNiUgYGJIOVrcBiYboZUYnfaxMOD+HoMASdPLC6QdRN\nfHNpy08H/N2TIiKkFplW\n=5/Iq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T12:01:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://a