8468/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jm8468","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/f0aa69d7edbd57e82218163d95e464b8cc06a714/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T12:58:21Z","email":"84189784+jm8468@users.noreply.github.com","name":"임서준"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T12:58:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[SCO-335] fix(scouter): 서류 평가 최종 결정 모달에 평가자 닉네임을 표시한다 (#166)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n서류 평가 페이지의 최종 합/불 결정 모달(`FinalEvalDialog`)에서 아직 평가를 제출하지 않은 평가자 목록이 닉네임이\n아닌 본명(`name`)으로 표시되고 있었어요.\n\n`documentEvaluatorStatuses` 응답에는 `name`과 `nickname`이 모두 내려오지만 이 모달만\n`name`을 쓰고 있어서, 닉네임으로 통일한 다른 화면(#164, #165)과 표시가 어긋났어요.\n\n## to-be\n\n미제출 평가자 목록이 `nickname`을 표시하도록 수정했어요.\n\n```diff\n {unsubmittedEvaluators.map((evaluator) => (\n-  <li key={evaluator.memberId}>{evaluator.name}</li>\n+  <li key={evaluator.memberId}>{evaluator.nickname}</li>\n ))}\n```\n\n검증:\n\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:type` 통과\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:lint` 통과\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:format` 통과\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음","tree":{"sha":"0e358a3ffa40fe71136960f20dac85758f63d471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/trees/0e358a3ffa40fe71136960f20dac85758f63d471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/commits/f0aa69d7edbd57e82218163d95e464b8cc06a714","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e358a3ffa40fe71136960f20dac85758f63d471\nparent aa1464400688822bffcf6fcad93eb7e375064fbc\nauthor 임서준 <84189784+jm8468@users.noreply.github.com> 1787489901 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787489901 +0900\n\n[SCO-335] fix(scouter): 서류 평가 최종 결정 모달에 평가자 닉네임을 표시한다 (#166)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n서류 평가 페이지의 최종 합/불 결정 모달(`FinalEvalDialog`)에서 아직 평가를 제출하지 않은 평가자 목록이 닉네임이\n아닌 본명(`name`)으로 표시되고 있었어요.\n\n`documentEvaluatorStatuses` 응답에는 `name`과 `nickname`이 모두 내려오지만 이 모달만\n`name`을 쓰고 있어서, 닉네임으로 통일한 다른 화면(#164, #165)과 표시가 어긋났어요.\n\n## to-be\n\n미제출 평가자 목록이 `nickname`을 표시하도록 수정했어요.\n\n```diff\n {unsubmittedEvaluators.map((evaluator) => (\n-  <li key={evaluator.memberId}>{evaluator.name}</li>\n+  <li key={evaluator.memberId}>{evaluator.nickname}</li>\n ))}\n```\n\n검증:\n\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:type` 통과\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:lint` 통과\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:format` 통과\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiu5tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApzoQACSiIAxcThZgxr8cS6pbHd29\nLfQWe9oJrcgYgPRPGcp70CafbdIrE2rgd/QGStA2rnoelx/Qm5FGhNX8FMRDfaeP\nVh6twnf4lF4emQzk6cdIjhPE1wukntjBGipNIi6GsrO72LoV3G4+EcRNKljj35/5\nCWw0Oz9VdCMUcBm/BoK1d+QuHqejit3YLDJTPyk3Td7MBnEidrK5cYB/zJTQ1zY8\nIC/bcbbSc/J9p2pgxSGR5p9cAsfxOrjHZ0RUzWHzT+Xd4gvr3HEQaOipmwIrmoic\niDqP4S9gMtbEHthkGSMFdPjL6BiMCH2qjkPYcKAa7HJgHSqlC0JKhWCodof/ulXv\nvmLmqiH51ye3LfbiNyNMNWL9qE2cV+5zBCgLUuE6RlC4pQt86oFnbby9nJsfEclV\njfwHpSsH+BVTBaxAfi3PeUtFK9+C5tIfhjgP3V0QRZ017zCRRo53ywuAwHNScSCt\nQ85tqPU9UGx9G0uPR2aaWXLafyLZoOuTzhD+wMOpoTEJWbd9/Z0jSqoVFWzepFA1\nEBFk2xriHcjXtlhhkTm4qBMzsI9uBWohA/VKIYjfHWhnwFsl3tuzONinQgDhCkVJ\nLIqPp2BQ0iMRNewmr/Mqx/qCnY13jeO5TY7L9ogEVIOniNWZEgknr8btU4g2exE9\n3i9xxUUIfAU6S7RWUlFu\n=cNvI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-23T12:58:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":