//api.github.com/users/jm8468","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/aa1464400688822bffcf6fcad93eb7e375064fbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T11:39:17Z","email":"84189784+jm8468@users.noreply.github.com","name":"임서준"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T11:39:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[SCO-334] fix(scouter): 최종 면접 평가 모달에 평가자 닉네임을 표시한다 (#165)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n최종 면접 합/불 결정 모달에서 아직 평가를 제출하지 않은 평가자 목록이 닉네임이 아닌 본명(`name`)으로 표시되고 있었어요.\n\n`InterviewEvaluatorStatusSchema`는 `name`과 `nickname`을 모두 내려주지만,\n`FinalInterviewEvaluationDialog`만 `name`을 사용하고 있어서 다른 화면(#164에서 닉네임으로\n통일)과 표시가 어긋났어요.\n\n## to-be\n\n`FinalInterviewEvaluationDialog`의 미제출 평가자 목록이 `nickname`을 표시하도록 수정했어요.\n\n```diff\n-{unsubmittedEvaluators.map(({ name, memberId }) => (\n-  <li key={memberId}>{name}</li>\n+{unsubmittedEvaluators.map(({ nickname, memberId }) => (\n+  <li key={memberId}>{nickname}</li>\n ))}\n```\n\n검증:\n\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:type` 통과\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:lint` 통과\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:format` 통과\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음","tree":{"sha":"1c6dc3780d1c37db79523e2b9236ad552aac4a4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/trees/1c6dc3780d1c37db79523e2b9236ad552aac4a4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/commits/aa1464400688822bffcf6fcad93eb7e375064fbc","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c6dc3780d1c37db79523e2b9236ad552aac4a4d\nparent e08d5b608a5c3cce34acb736e0b39d10d6fed073\nauthor 임서준 <84189784+jm8468@users.noreply.github.com> 1787485157 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787485157 +0900\n\n[SCO-334] fix(scouter): 최종 면접 평가 모달에 평가자 닉네임을 표시한다 (#165)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n최종 면접 합/불 결정 모달에서 아직 평가를 제출하지 않은 평가자 목록이 닉네임이 아닌 본명(`name`)으로 표시되고 있었어요.\n\n`InterviewEvaluatorStatusSchema`는 `name`과 `nickname`을 모두 내려주지만,\n`FinalInterviewEvaluationDialog`만 `name`을 사용하고 있어서 다른 화면(#164에서 닉네임으로\n통일)과 표시가 어긋났어요.\n\n## to-be\n\n`FinalInterviewEvaluationDialog`의 미제출 평가자 목록이 `nickname`을 표시하도록 수정했어요.\n\n```diff\n-{unsubmittedEvaluators.map(({ name, memberId }) => (\n-  <li key={memberId}>{name}</li>\n+{unsubmittedEvaluators.map(({ nickname, memberId }) => (\n+  <li key={memberId}>{nickname}</li>\n ))}\n```\n\n검증:\n\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:type` 통과\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:lint` 통과\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter check:format` 통과\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqitvlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJKMQALFIWeHW8wMyWtoGXFp7tuqQ\nYuY/NhphUlakkgncdGuv97vCmApkl5QRjltcvSf44evROK6uXQKQ8mf6QxYhU33k\ngKV3a7FWgaohUrJLAOut67r2pP302mVqrrx7hMhGkNDijWn0c19ZquOi+4g0iRlJ\nrgXgcIe55TgH0ITYkfU9n84C5Jc70A5JT1dIbHYDclWTqZePV3jzXv+1zmxXfoEA\nc3vGoLG2xdO2ToCNQh3nwaMXJqT1BXsUpOKCbnK0jf3Jb3BT2PfItYBSCdWp+TDd\nh7GAWK+vh6ERXbrpEs3Ot63dJbx5ymeRBQUUTKOhNmWjHSp/n6yNO3nYhJ5RRPwh\nmpVoX4zRo9sfxhJszMcBPSYXzzd15GxjSHdZcE4WhUdENSxVEH3DbypXSezNiosv\nCAViul1wujHCRdfOv/2Zh9Cnr4MbTnOMy/VTQU5AHWmQEk4noCgnM4B2XAXHSrf4\naLTVuKf5GV5rZ3pDkH+H8tx4ITaxBbJTK8FhvWI6BYA0qwJkdjKZnL/ng7XcJAmJ\nS6sWxeJ/hVN9PWaqSYfRfB1D6MYhurN8vDQlm6/WTsX7AMaJFhzkoFDjH1ElsC09\nkhkAvXjSO6YzQ3UaQPQ5MI9wmfgr+AQpLZrT63igQgbzPvPjsAQrl7Yj+KVtxa0e\npvt7rRVO1CHYmmXLrHM9\n=TfZm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-23T11:39:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"lo