":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/e498e780e84bf0233a974bb136f29f1cf63bb89f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T14:41:54Z","email":"2wndrhs@gmail.com","name":"이중곤"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T14:41:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[SCO-294] feat(scouter): 지원자 테이블에 심사 상태를 표시한다 (#136)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n- 지원자 목록의 체크박스와 일괄 상태 변경 UI를 제거했어요.\n- 지원일 컬럼을 제거하고 심사 상태 컬럼을 추가했어요.\n- 지원자 상태와 파트의 과제 진행 여부를 조합해 서류·과제·면접 평가 진행 단계를 표시해요.\n- 불합격 및 최종 합격 상태는 기존 결과 문구를 유지해요.\n\n## to-be\n\n<img width=\"1353\" height=\"791\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8869d388-6c60-4a72-868c-4f6dc87e8dae\"\n/>\n\n검증:\n- `.agents/skills/inhouse-skill/scripts/validate-workspace.sh\n@yourssu-inhouse/scouter --test-if-present` 통과 (type, lint, format)\n- `pnpm --filter @yourssu-inhouse/scouter exec vite build`에서 프로덕션 번들 생성\n성공\n- `pnpm turbo run build --filter=@yourssu-inhouse/scouter`는 기존\n`EvalForm/index.tsx:70`의 React Hook Form `Resolver` 타입 불일치로 중단\n- Scouter test script 없음\n- 브라우저 수동 검증 미수행\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음","tree":{"sha":"ad7373b4bddb01cc1a11b839d3bb360bf5947bc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/trees/ad7373b4bddb01cc1a11b839d3bb360bf5947bc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/commits/e498e780e84bf0233a974bb136f29f1cf63bb89f","verification":{"payload":"tree ad7373b4bddb01cc1a11b839d3bb360bf5947bc1\nparent b9cdbdadaea08bae34b44b3f9