ts":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yourssu/inhouse-client/commit/7e8de06238c13a76e085788ceb08c8c9c19f2d03","sha":"7e8de06238c13a76e085788ceb08c8c9c19f2d03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/7e8de06238c13a76e085788ceb08c8c9c19f2d03"}],"sha":"b9cdbdadaea08bae34b44b3f9690970b6769d71d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/b9cdbdadaea08bae34b44b3f9690970b6769d71d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76615094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/2wndrhs","id":76615094,"login":"2wndrhs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjE1MDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2wndrhs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/commits/7e8de06238c13a76e085788ceb08c8c9c19f2d03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T13:58:49Z","email":"2wndrhs@gmail.com","name":"이중곤"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T13:58:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[SCO-293] fix(scouter): 질문 카테고리별 요구조건 전송을 반영한다 (#134)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n- 라이브 OpenAPI에 맞춰 `SaveAssignedQuestionRequest.requirementIds`를\noptional·nullable로 반영했습니다.\n- 질문지 저장 시 요구조건을 변경하지 않아야 하는 카테고리의 요청 payload를 수정했습니다.\n- 관련 Linear 이슈:\n[SCO-293](https://linear.app/urssuscouter/issue/SCO-293/fe-질문지-저장-요청의-requirementids-카테고리별-전송-반영)\n\n## to-be\n\n- `INTRO`, `OUTRO`, `CULTURE` 질문은 저장 요청에서 `requirementIds`를 누락합니다.\n- `PART`, `PERSONAL` 질문은 기존처럼 `requirementIds` 배열을 전송합니다.\n- Scouter 타입 검사, ESLint, Prettier, 빌드를 통과했습니다.\n- 컬처핏 요청 직렬화 결과에 `requirementIds`가 포함되지 않는 것을 스모크 체크했습니다.\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음","tree":{"sha":"4a651300c121ef1fbf425469a99237a3eac5210c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/trees/4a651300c121ef1fbf425469a99237a3eac5210c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yourssu/inhouse-client/git/commits/7e8de06238c13a76e085788ceb08c8c9c19f2d03","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a651300c121ef1fbf425469a99237a3eac5210c\nparent 730a2e5147859a3e8e3df5f14e5b1ee9eee4c540\nauthor 이중곤 <2wndrhs@gmail.com> 1787320729 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787320729 +0900\n\n[SCO-293] fix(scouter): 질문 카테고리별 요구조건 전송을 반영한다 (#134)\n\n# 📝 변경 사항\n\n## 개요\n\n- 라이브 OpenAPI에 맞춰 `SaveAssignedQuestionRequest.requirementIds`를\noptional·nullable로 반영했습니다.\n- 질문지 저장 시 요구조건을 변경하지 않아야 하는 카테고리의 요청 payload를 수정했습니다.\n- 관련 Linear 이슈:\n[SCO-293](https://linear.app/urssuscouter/issue/SCO-293/fe-질문지-저장-요청의-requirementids-카테고리별-전송-반영)\n\n## to-be\n\n- `INTRO`, `OUTRO`, `CULTURE` 질문은 저장 요청에서 `requirementIds`를 누락합니다.\n- `PART`, `PERSONAL` 질문은 기존처럼 `requirementIds` 배열을 전송합니다.\n- Scouter 타입 검사, ESLint, Prettier, 빌드를 통과했습니다.\n- 컬처핏 요청 직렬화 결과에 `requirementIds`가 포함되지 않는 것을 스모크 체크했습니다.\n\n# 🔗 같이 보면 좋아요\n\n## Figma\n\n해당 없음\n\n## Slack\n\n해당 없음","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiFmZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfDQQAAd6Vydw9VPJh7yy6AdEMJM5\nKG6tf5BIJxTwmejyzPQk9WfWZ9hR7iw06np+ipWzUcW7VRtBXBE6nLUcf6O9VsCl\nu3IY+/N+BKWaII9IiZaPczo/kuY01xwejmJYz6qmsIi6NRci8HCi0QRKPzjzJt7S\n6Gnx3IxhpRuWcEA2I4AV4vcjaKGJW8GERg2wXAnBkhOKT8oK7F3SjcEvNmXHUkuc\ngtrqQimyMfF4WbqpahCMXAz6Kh3vmTtEgF2g2HtjogdxI2vm4SOuhIqWsYoF4KBM\nYroClpUzkpql6YHt2nePDhkahhLdOWEYYpcem/+06q8b2PcmigVr6vbUPYSSeo5H\nhBnQb/NV1Ru67bbCnXEhYOLzWCxqAO