ent dividers between stats\n- Blur entrance on scroll-reveal (filter: blur(8px) → 0)\n- Enhanced modal with backdrop blur and close button rotation\n- Gradient line on footer top border\n\nAccessibility: all effects respect prefers-reduced-motion, cursor/particle\neffects disabled on touch devices via @media (hover: none).\n\nProduction build: zero warnings, 6.84 kB CSS, 4 pages exported.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"484805ec0d6d33c89e26399a12e2e54a78af622b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/484805ec0d6d33c89e26399a12e2e54a78af622b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/7aec3504365ac05d21bbff39803d310a78e1a08e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/7aec3504365ac05d21bbff39803d31