folio redesign with modern dark theme\n\n- Replace Devman template with custom dark theme (indigo/purple accents)\n- New design system: CSS custom properties, Inter font, glass-morphism header\n- Replace wowjs with IntersectionObserver scroll-reveal animations\n- Replace fontello icons with inline SVGs throughout\n- Replace skill progress bars with categorized tech chips\n- Modern hero section with gradient text, floating stat badges, scroll hint\n- Responsive: tested at desktop/tablet/mobile with no horizontal overflow\n- Remove preloader, custom cursor, and other dated template patterns\n- Modernize all popups with overlay click-to-close and Escape key support\n- Update SEO metadata and structured data\n- Production build: zero warnings, 5.15 kB CSS\n\n24 files rewritten end-to-end across components, layouts, styles, and data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48d2d5c5453a01fd001c9a758aa25625c5a57cf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/48d2d5c5453a01fd001c9a758aa25625c5a57cf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/11e9aaa6713207fa2ab66e57dfae2cc76047a004","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events