 PDF tools\n\nSame three tools as toolnest — see that repo''s history for the full\nwrite-up. TXT/CSV build a real vector PDF directly with pdf-lib\n(textToPdf/csvToPdf/parseCsv in office.ts); HTML reuses the existing\nhtmlToPdfBlob/printHtmlToPdf pair Word to PDF already uses, via a new\nhtmlFileToPdfHtml() that extracts and sanitizes an uploaded document''s\n<style> and <body> content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0a6f3b7707bb02a888a4a80316d54dd847c6ad7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/d0a6f3b7707bb02a888a4a80316d54dd847c6ad7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/1e0e25190c07801cc6e9f7c5ada14daab0450294","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/1e0e25190c07801cc6e9f7c5ada14da