en PDF tool\n\nSame tool as toolnest — see that repo''s history for the full write-up.\nBakes a PDF''s fillable AcroForm fields into permanent page content via\npdf-lib''s PDFForm.flatten(), then removes the now-empty form. Inserted\nafter Unlock PDF in this repo''s own route order (this mirror doesn''t\nyet carry the standalone repo''s separate Protect PDF tool).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f6944e8d082958bfac3461914fde65f3b699e42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/0f6944e8d082958bfac3461914fde65f3b699e42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/e0c17d8e632316c3a1624b6a0049da6651bd2ecf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/e0c17d8e632316c3a1624b6a0049da6651bd2ecf","node_id":"C_kwDOTDGIntoAKGUwYzE3ZDhlNjMyMzE2YzNhMTYyNGI2YTAwNDlkYTY2NTFiZDJlY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/ebc7e75b850ad1ff499efab355d494fac9012013","sha":"ebc7e75b850ad1ff499efab355d494fac9012013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/ebc7e75b850ad1ff499efab355d494fac9012013"}],"sha":"e0c17d8e632316c3a1624b6a0049da6651bd2ecf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/e0c17d8e632316c3a1624b6a0049da6651bd2ecf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/ebc7e75b850ad1ff499efab355d494fac9012013/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:25:15Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:25:15Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"message":"fix(edit-pdf): preserve real ink color, add a custom color picker, fix the floating toolbar sticking open\n\nSame fix as toolnest — see that repo''s history for the full write-up.\n\n1. sampleRunColors() assumed ink is always darker than its background,\n   so light/white text on a dark banner or dark theme sampled its own\n   background as \"ink,\" making the patched replacement text invisible\n   against its own whiteout cover. Ink is now the color bucket that\n   differs most from the detected background, with an absolute minimum\n   pixel count (not a percentage of the sample) to reject anti-aliasing\n   noise without rejecting genuinely thin-stroke ink along with it.\n\n2. Every color control offered only 6-7 fixed presets with no way to\n   pick anything else. Added CustomColorSwatch — a native\n   `<input type=\"color\">` matching the existing swatch-button\n   convention — to every color row, showing a rainbow icon until a\n   non-preset value is active.\n\n3. The floating per-element toolbar never dismissed on a click outside\n   it once \"text\" (the default tool) was active — the deselect guard\n   only fired for \"select\". Narrowed it to only protect clicks that\n   land on a page''s own <svg> (a real creation gesture); everywhere\n   else in the chrome now deselects unconditionally regardless of tool.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46a11ce8e6f471430fa66f4144d4c4c22a78db79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/46a11ce8e6f471430fa66f4144d4c4c22a78db79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/ebc7e75b850ad1ff499efab355d494fac9012013","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/ebc7e75b850ad1ff499efab355d494fac9012013","node_id":"C_kwDOTDGIntoAKGViYzdlNzViODUwYWQxZmY0OTllZmFiMzU1ZDQ5NGZhYzkwMTIwMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/fadc7b6220ac5f6af22d187d1a8eb3970e1fa2a2","sha":"fadc7b6220ac5f6af22d187d1a8eb3970e1fa2a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/fadc7b6220ac5f6af22d187d1a8eb3970e1fa2a2"}],"sha":"ebc7e75b850ad1ff499efab355d494fac9012013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/ebc7e75b850ad1ff499efab355d494fac9012013"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/fadc7b6220ac5f6af22d187d1a8eb3970e1fa2a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:20:16Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:20:16Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"message":"fix(edit-pdf): fetch custom font bytes from the right origin in dev, and stop sharing a mutable file-bytes buffer\n\nSame fix as toolnest — see that repo''s history for the full write-up.\n\nloadEmbeddedFonts() imported the bundled Arimo/Tinos/Cousine .ttf files\nvia Vite''s `?url`, which resolves to a root-relative dev-server path\nthat only resolves correctly once everything is assembled onto one\norigin for production. Under the federated multi-port `npm run dev`\nsetup it resolves against the shell''s origin instead of pdf-tools''\nown, 404s, and the unchecked fetch handed fontkit the 404 page''s body\nas if it were a font program, surfacing only as fontkit''s opaque\n\"Unknown font format\" with no hint the real problem was a wrong-origin\nfetch. Every PDF export containing a text edit failed under local dev.\n\nFixed by resolving each font''s URL with `new URL(path, import.meta.url)`\ninstead, and by checking `res.ok` before treating the response body as\nfont bytes so a future failure here fails loudly instead of silently.\n\nAlso hardened useFileBytes() to return a fresh `.slice(0)` of its\ncached buffer on every call rather than the same shared ArrayBuffer\nobject, closing a StrictMode-era race with pdf.js''s buffer-transferring\nrender path that was observed once flipping a single byte in the\nexported PDF''s original page content stream, corrupting its DEFLATE\ndata with no error shown anywhere.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3dae44438ebe30ef0af4c65c02f00f0ea961f338","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/3dae44438ebe30ef0af4c65c02f00f0ea961f338"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/fadc7b6220ac5f6af22d187d1a8eb3970e1fa2a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/fadc7b6220ac5f6af22d187d1a8eb3970e1fa2a2","node_id":"C_kwDOTDGIntoAKGZhZGM3YjYyMjBhYzVmNmFmMjJkMTg3ZDFhOGViMzk3MGUxZmEyYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/7f00bb32ad7c4474b307fbbb8be20ca1b3704022","sha":"7f00bb32ad7c4474b307fbbb8be20ca1b3704022","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/7f00bb32ad7c4474b307fbbb8be20ca1b3704022"}],"sha":"fadc7b6220ac5f6af22d187d1a8eb3970e1fa2a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/fadc7b6220ac5f6af22d187d1a8eb3970e1fa2a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/7f00bb32ad7c4474b307fbbb8be20ca1b3704022/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:48:36Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:48:36Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"message":"fix(edit-pdf): duplicating or deleting patched text no longer corrupts its cover\n\nSynced from toolnest. Duplicating a patched text (existing-text patch\npipeline, design doc §3) copied its coverId verbatim, leaving the\nduplicate sharing its ORIGINAL''s whiteout cover instead of getting its\nown -- so changing either''s background color silently repainted a\nrectangle sitting under the OTHER one. Deleting a patched text left its\ncover behind: a blank white rectangle with nothing drawn on it,\npermanently hiding the original line.\n\nduplicateAnnotation now duplicates the cover alongside a patched text''s\ncopy, and deleteAnnotation now removes a patched text''s cover in the\nsame step -- both fixed together, since deleting-cascade alone would\nhave been actively worse against a cover two texts still shared.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84226d8f5f9838f63c89d97c1ddee83ca3b3b613","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/84226d8f5f9838f63c89d97c1ddee83ca3b3b613"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/7f00bb32ad7c4474b307fbbb8be20ca1b3704022","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/7f00bb32ad7c4474b307fbbb8be20ca1b3704022","node_id":"C_kwDOTDGIntoAKDdmMDBiYjMyYWQ3YzQ0NzRiMzA3ZmJiYjhiZTIwY2ExYjM3MDQwMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/398fc7cc2be6b1f30c7122bbddcdb3f833ea094b","sha":"398fc7cc2be6b1f30c7122bbddcdb3f833ea094b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/398fc7cc2be6b1f30c7122bbddcdb3f833ea094b"}],"sha":"7f00bb32ad7c4474b307fbbb8be20ca1b3704022","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/7f00bb32ad7c4474b307fbbb8be20ca1b3704022"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/398fc7cc2be6b1f30c7122bbddcdb3f833ea094b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T19:05:40Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T19:05:40Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"message":"fix(edit-pdf): make re-editing an already-edited PDF work correctly\n\nSynced from toolnest. Found by an end-to-end round trip (edit -> apply ->\nreopen the exported file -> edit again), which restored the original text\nand styling instead of the replacement''s. Three separate causes:\n\n1. findRunAt picked the wrong run. Patching is additive, so an edited\n   file legitimately holds two runs at the same coordinates: the buried\n   original and the visible replacement. Both score distance 0 and the\n   `<` tie-break kept the first, i.e. the earlier-drawn original. Now\n   `<=`, so the later -- and therefore visible -- run wins.\n\n2. Bold/italic were dropped. pdf.js''s resolved flags were made\n   authoritative via `??`, so an explicit false beat a font name that\n   spells out BoldItalic; pdf.js reads false whenever the embedded\n   descriptor omits the flags. The two signals now OR together, since\n   each is blind in a different situation.\n\n3. Family flipped to Helvetica. pdf.js labels the editor''s own Tinos (a\n   Times clone) \"sans-serif\", and matching name and generic word in one\n   pass let that wrong generic win. Real typeface names are now matched\n   first, the generic word only as a fallback.\n\nVerified: round trip now restores text, family, size, bold and italic,\nand an untouched neighbouring line still resolves correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aeb12353b947d57f22ec8ecb1fbc0b6151351c89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/aeb12353b947d57f22ec8ecb1fbc0b6151351c89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/398fc7cc2be6b1f30c7122bbddcdb3f833ea094b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/398fc7cc2be6b1f30c7122bbddcdb3f833ea094b","node_id":"C_kwDOTDGIntoAKDM5OGZjN2NjMmJlNmIxZjMwYzcxMjJiYmRkY2RiM2Y4MzNlYTA5NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/ce744dc661d01691214d866a9369f5551ebea853","sha":"ce744dc661d01691214d866a9369f5551ebea853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/ce744dc661d01691214d866a9369f5551ebea853"}],"sha":"398fc7cc2be6b1f30c7122bbddcdb3f833ea094b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/398fc7cc2be6b1f30c7122bbddcdb3f833ea094b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth07