ist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/fddb4b692513993738169ddc5bf9dae8f1b8cc20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:42:28Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:42:28Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"message":"fix(edit-pdf): embed real fonts instead of named standard fonts\n\nSynced from toolnest. Root cause of the recurring font-mismatch report\n(font doesn''t match the original after edit): pdf-lib''s StandardFonts\narent embedded font programs at all -- just a /BaseFont name reference\nthat every PDF viewer substitutes its own local font for, inconsistent\nacross viewers and never matching this editors own on-screen preview\neither.\n\nBundles Arimo/Tinos/Cousine (OFL-licensed, metric-compatible clones of\nArial/Times New Roman/Courier New) and embeds the real font bytes via\n@pdf-lib/fontkit for both the exported PDF and the on-screen CSS preview\n(same files, via new @font-face rules), so what you see while editing\nnow matches what comes out, verified by parsing the exported PDF back\nand confirming a real embedded font program (FontFile2) rather than a\nbare name reference.\n\nAlso fixes tools/scripts/serve-static.mjs (missing .ttf MIME type) and\nadds a toolnest-static launch config entry for local production-build\nverification against the standalone toolnest repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5740721f8ed72d8b5d91cf589c20ea5ae3719ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/b5740721f8ed72d8b5d91cf589c20ea5ae3719ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/fddb4b692513993738169ddc5bf9dae8f1b8cc20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/fddb4b692513993738169ddc5bf9dae8f1b8cc20","node_id":"C_kwDOTDGIntoAKGZkZGI0YjY5MjUxMzk5MzczODE2OWRkYzViZjlkYWU4ZjFiOGNjMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/a96079158fb43822c23fc343dcd3c3bda4b752d5","sha":"a96079158fb43822c23fc343dcd3c3bda4b752d5","url":"