modal\n- Full responsive mobile layout, dark mode compatible\n\nFeatures (from previous sessions):\n- Drag-to-move for text and pen annotations (useDragDelta hook)\n- Auto-edit existing text on click with text tool\n- Images/signatures placed on visible page, not always page 1\n- Tool prop passed to AnnotationView for proper tool-specific behavior\n\nBug fixes:\n- PenAnnotationView: stable useMemo deps (scalar ddx/ddy)\n- PenPath: pointerEvents=none on stroke path\n- TextAnnotationView: simplified pointerDown stale-state fix\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"848ba18f9f1e2f0e79cdbc9a36cf2b604b3a8fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/848ba18f9f1e2f0e79cdbc9a36cf2b604b3a8fa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/4ec44560422084ef84c2d2d5cb4143558cbe8196","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth0