ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/35c4dc0036e60ee30cbeaa128db624c549ad9a11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T19:21:34Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T19:21:34Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"message":"fix(shell): add static preboot loader to eliminate white-screen flash\n\nNavigating to /tools/ showed a blank white screen for a few seconds\nwhile the JS bundle and CSS downloaded and React mounted, since\nindex.html previously had nothing but an empty #root div. Add an\ninline, dependency-free loader (spinner + brand mark, themed via a\nsynchronous localStorage read) directly in the HTML so something\nrenders on first paint. React''s createRoot().render() replaces it\nautomatically once the app mounts — no teardown code needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f492d776bc1a1a11618f5d8a379342110f28efd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/tree