th077"},"message":"feat(ui): add animated Spinner component as page loader\n\nAdd a proper SVG spinner with rotating arc animation and label text.\nReplace all plain-text \"Loading…\" Suspense fallbacks with <Spinner>\nacross the shell ToolPage and all three remote ToolRoutes files.\n\nShows a centered spinner with \"Loading {tool name}…\" while lazy-loaded\nremote chunks are fetched — gives visual feedback on slower connections.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7aa4553667ca4384f0e487fd8275d252a109a181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/7aa4553667ca4384f0e487fd8275d252a109a181"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/0fb27808a36db0cc9f4d7e69e9eb5f16f36d3e7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.githu