ikanth077"},"message":"fix(unlock-pdf): restructure to show password form when needed\n\nThe previous version wrapped unlockPdf() inside run(), which caused the\nuseProcessor error handler to catch PdfPasswordRequiredError instead of the\ntry/catch block. This prevented the password form from showing.\n\nRestructured so unlockPdf() is called directly in a try/catch. Only use run()\nafter we know the outcome (owner-unlock succeeded, or password flow needed).\nThis lets the error be caught immediately and the password form be displayed.\n\nAlso added better UI states:\n- \"Checking…\" button text while trying owner unlock\n- Disabled password input while rendering\n- Download link shown in success message\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30493ee69488c0f930f7af946edad62cf89fce59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/30493ee69488c0f930f7af946edad62cf89fce59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/8575685762e2476fbc730f0df1a0d3def0dbb9dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/8575685762e2476fbc730f0df1a0d3def0dbb9dc","node_id":"C_kwDOTDGIntoAKDg1NzU2ODU3NjJlMjQ3NmZiYzczMGYwZGYxYTBkM2RlZjBkYmI5ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/0b1487c7ae5a609d26aeddba286fe131b18a6ede","sha":"0b1487c7ae5a609d26aeddba286fe131b18a6ede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/0b1487c7ae5a609d26aeddba286fe131b18a6ede"}],"sha":"8575685762e2476fbc730f0df1a0d3def0dbb9dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/8575685762e2476fbc730f0df1a0d3def0dbb9dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/0b1487c7ae5a609d26aeddba286fe131b18a6ede/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:12:53Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:12:53Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"message":"feat(unlock-pdf): add password entry for user-password protected PDFs\n\nWhen pdf-lib cannot copy pages (user-password/open-password PDF), instead of\nerroring, the UI now shows a password input field. On submit, pdfjs-dist opens\nthe document with the password, rasterises each page, and pdf-lib rebuilds an\nunlocked copy. Wrong passwords are caught (PasswordException) and shown inline\nwith focus returned to the field. Progress is shown per page for large PDFs.\n\nOwner-password PDFs (no-print/no-copy/no-edit) still unlock without a password\nvia the lossless pdf-lib path.\n\n- pdf.ts: add PdfPasswordRequiredError class; unlockPdf throws it instead of generic Error\n- pdf-render.ts: add unlockWithPassword(bytes, password, onProgress)\n- UnlockPdf.tsx: two-phase UI — try owner unlock first, show password form on PdfPasswordRequiredError\n- routes.ts: update caveat to reflect both unlock paths\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a46960e7c38c304a68dc5506ae60f62fb0d881c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/a46960e7c38c304a68dc5506ae60f62fb0d881c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/0b1487c7ae5a609d26aeddba286fe131b18a6ede","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other