ts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/cb0c727dacb2fb972e73a60cf259165a8b15b5b3","node_id":"C_kwDOTDGIntoAKGNiMGM3MjdkYWNiMmZiOTcyZTczYTYwY2YyNTkxNjVhOGIxNWI1YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/77c05d4f1cfb14e974ed3032d45e255d7caa9d02","sha":"77c05d4f1cfb14e974ed3032d45e255d7caa9d02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/77c05d4f1cfb14e974ed3032d45e255d7caa9d02"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/ef04825aa51cf44f5d47f95f24ea01200157e70b","sha":"ef04825aa51cf44f5d47f95f24ea01200157e70b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/ef04825aa51cf44f5d47f95f24ea01200157e70b"}],"sha":"cb0c727dacb2fb972e73a60cf259165a8b15b5b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/cb0c727dacb2fb972e73a60cf259165a8b15b5b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/ef04825aa51cf44f5d47f95f24ea01200157e70b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T02:05:41Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T02:05:41Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"message":"Add proper header/footer and audience-split navigation to the tools platform\n\nThe shell previously had a minimal single-row header (burger, wordmark,\ntheme toggle) with no footer, and every tool sat in one flat sidebar list.\nReworked it into a real information architecture, referencing Smallpdf''s\ncategory-dropdown pattern for the header while keeping the footer in the\nportfolio''s own voice.\n\nAudience split (new `audience` field on ToolRoute, plus a finer `category`\ntaxonomy replacing the old flat PDF/Images/Encoding/... set):\n\n  General Tools (16)     Organize, Convert, Optimize, Images, Generate\n  Developer Tools (7)    Encoding, Formatting, Inspection, Utilities\n\nQR and barcode generators moved from \"Generators\" into General Tools —\nthey''re marketing/everyday tools, not developer utilities. UUID stayed\nin Developer Tools.\n\nHeader (apps/shell/src/components/Header.tsx): two audience mega-menu\ndropdowns, each a multi-column panel of categories and tool links, closing\non outside click, Escape, or link selection. Brand is now the platform''s\nown identity (\"DevTools Studio\", by Shashikanth Hosur Ramegowda) rather\nthan a copy of the portfolio''s personal-name header.\n\nFooter (apps/shell/src/components/Footer.tsx): deliberately mirrors the\nportfolio''s Copyright.js wording verbatim — \"Developed by {name} © {year}\"\n— so the two sites read as one person''s work. Adding it exposed a real\nsidebar bug: `.shell-sidebar` used a fixed `height: calc(100vh - header)`,\nwhich forces the row to always be a full viewport tall regardless of\ncontent, pushing the new footer off-screen on every short tool page.\nSwitched to `max-height` + `align-self: flex-start`.\n\nSidebar and the home page grid are regrouped by audience > category via\nnew `routesFor()` / `groupByAudience()` helpers in routes.ts.\n`groupByCategory()` no longer takes a hardcoded category-order array —\nit now preserves first-appearance order from the routes passed in, so\nthere''s one fewer list to keep in sync when tools move between categories.\n\nPortfolio: nav label \"Tools\" -> \"DevTools Studio\" (constants.js), matching\nthe platform''s own brand rather than a generic link label. Also fixed the\nfooter credit link, which had always pointed at href=\"#\" — now links to\nLinkedIn, and the tools footer uses the same real destination.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"766d23a218667c0224c9acc8e4ca023d575809c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/766d23a218667c0224c9acc8e4ca023d575809c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/ef04825aa51cf44f5d47f95f24ea01200157e70b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":nul