","node_id":"C_kwDOTDGIntoAKDc3YzA1ZDRmMWNmYjE0ZTk3NGVkMzAzMmQ0NWUyNTVkN2NhYTlkMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/4a41ef1569d76015a89661eacf69ff61b7f2b257","sha":"4a41ef1569d76015a89661eacf69ff61b7f2b257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/4a41ef1569d76015a89661eacf69ff61b7f2b257"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/708d688697ab9a0434254cfdceb938a480f4d415","sha":"708d688697ab9a0434254cfdceb938a480f4d415","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/708d688697ab9a0434254cfdceb938a480f4d415"}],"sha":"77c05d4f1cfb14e974ed3032d45e255d7caa9d02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/77c05d4f1cfb14e974ed3032d45e255d7caa9d02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commits/708d688697ab9a0434254cfdceb938a480f4d415/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T17:05:54Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T17:05:54Z","email":"shashikanth033@gmail.com","name":"shashikanth077"},"message":"Add PDF, Word and image tools as two new remotes\n\nGrows the platform from 9 tools to 23 by adding two Module Federation remotes:\npdf-tools (11) and image-tools (3).\n\nPDF, via pdf-lib — lossless page-level work, no content stream is re-encoded:\nmerge, split by range or per page, delete/keep pages, rotate, images to PDF.\nVia pdf.js: PDF to images, PDF to text. Via mammoth: Word to HTML.\n\nThree conversions ship as honest approximations rather than being omitted.\nEach carries a `caveat` in the route manifest, rendered at the top of the tool\nso the limitation is stated before the output is relied on:\n\n  PDF to Word   text rebuilt as .docx; paragraphs inferred from vertical gaps,\n                fonts/columns/tables do not survive\n  Word to PDF   rasterised download, plus a \"Print to PDF\" path that uses the\n                browser''s own engine and keeps text selectable\n  Compress PDF  rasterises pages; on a text PDF this makes the file bigger, and\n                the tool reports the real before/after numbers when it does\n\nOCR is not attempted, and \"unlock\" only strips permission flags — it does not\ncrack passwords.\n\nUI additions in libs/ui: drag-and-drop with enter/leave depth counting, file\ncards with thumbnails and reordering, progress bars, a result grid, and a\ndependency-free ZIP writer (stored entries — the outputs are already\ncompressed, so DEFLATE would spend CPU for nothing).\n\nTwo pdf.js behaviours cost real debugging and are commented at the call site:\n\n- `canvas` and `canvasContext` are mutually exclusive. Passing both leaves the\n  render promise pending forever — no error, no rejection, just a hang.\n- Rendering uses `intent: \"print\"`. pdf.js drives the display intent with\n  requestAnimationFrame, which browsers stop firing in a hidden tab, so a user\n  who starts a long conversion and switches tabs would watch it stall.\n\nAlso: tools-core modules stay split per heavy library so a tool only downloads\nwhat it calls, and the `@devtools/ui/` alias now resolves subpaths generically\nrather than listing each stylesheet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8bf5d7021b4ae3f624e261cca94974466f2b42ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/trees/8bf5d7021b4ae3f624e261cca94974466f2b42ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/git/commits/708d688697ab9a0434254cfdceb938a480f4d415","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57744709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077","id":57744709,"login":"shashikanth077","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashikanth077","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shashikanth077/shashikanth077.github.io/commit/708d688697ab9a0434254cfdceb938a480f4d415","node_id":"C_kwD