latPath }},\n  提前採用 v7 行為並消除 console 警告。\n- 表情 chip 加 aria-label(「{emoji} 反應 N 人(含你)」)與 aria-pressed,改善 a11y;\n  對應 Thread 測試的 query 隨之更新。\n- 新增 ChatApp.test.tsx 煙霧測試(mock api/socket/call):掛載渲染側欄 + 空對話提示不崩潰,\n  補上 ChatApp 原本缺的測試覆蓋。\n\nchat vitest 118 passed、三 app tsc 乾淨。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2eaa835ef5057e01b73d4d979d37d82d7ad5a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/f2eaa835ef5057e01b73d4d979d37d82d7ad5a5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/eb3b8d77fda96d4c9ce8de019dc01963d85bc77f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/eb3b8d77fda96d4c9ce8de019dc01963d85bc77f","node_id":"C_kwDOTDdM4toAKGViM2I4ZDc3ZmRhOTZkNGM5Y2U4ZGUwMTlkYzAxOTYzZDg1YmM3N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/dfe5abd5e3f101db5caa1bad25715c0b202692e5","sha":"dfe5abd5e3f101db5caa1bad25715c0b202692e