ava5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/7299b6b20741dc97c7ea3f962e866c44078ce52c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T02:36:09Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T02:36:09Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[chore][ci][repo] 新增 GitHub Actions CI(backend pytest + 前端三 app typecheck/vitest)\n\n- backend job:setup-python 3.12 + pip install -e \".[dev]\" + python -m pytest\n  (測試走檔案型 SQLite,不需外部 Postgres/Docker)。\n- frontend job:matrix [shell, auth, chat],各 npm ci + typecheck + vitest。\n- push main / 任何 PR 觸發;同分支取消前一輪(concurrency)。\n\n註:目前 repo 無 remote,workflow 推到 GitHub 後才會實際執行;此處已驗 YAML 結構正確、\n所跑指令與本機通過的測試(backend 148、各 app tsc/vitest)一致。E2E(Playwright)較重,\n暫不入 CI,日後可另開 job。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24dd1d0e574b8d7c6a49ecd2df6b55d75fb504a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/24dd1d0e574b8d7c6a49ecd2df6b55d75fb504a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/7299b6b20741dc97c7ea3f962e866c44078ce52c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://