iptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/a5f40639f9946a0872781f56531a0186db4cb9dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T02:20:40Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T02:20:40Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[mvp][feat][backend] 登入速率限制(每 IP 失敗次數),降低暴力破解\n\n新增 app/ratelimit.py 的記憶體滑動視窗 limiter(單程序,與 presence 同限制)。\n/auth/login 在驗證前先查該 IP 近期登入失敗數,超過(預設 60 秒 10 次)回 429;\n只記「失敗」,成功登入不計入。來源 key 取 client.host(正式環境若在代理後,於代理層\n設可信 X-Forwarded-For 再據此取值)。\n\n測試:test_ratelimit 純邏輯(注入 now 驗視窗/隔離/重置)、test_auth 整合(10 次失敗\n後 429、被擋期間正確密碼也 429、成功登入不被擋)。conftest autouse fixture 逐測 reset\nlimiter(測試共用 testclient IP)。backend 148 passed。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e33d561d422242abb7deb1506b69b94d326f384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/5e33d561d422242abb7deb1506b69b94d326f384"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/a5f40639f9946a0872781f56531a0186db4cb9dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin"