,"name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T02:03:28Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[mvp][perf][backend] contacts / notifications 清單消除 N+1(批次查詢)\n\n#3 contacts:list_contacts 原本逐位好友 get_or_create_direct_conversation(每位一次\nSELECT)。新增 get_or_create_direct_conversations:常見情況(對話加好友時就建好)只需\n一次 IN 查詢,缺漏才補建。\n\n#4 notifications:list_notifications 原本每則 serialize_notification 各 db.get(actor)\n+ db.get(message)= 2N 查詢。抽出 _notification_dict 單一真相,新增 serialize_notifications\n批次版(actor / 訊息各一次 IN)。serialize_notification(單筆)留給 WS 即時推播。\n\n附帶:attachment.message_id 不另加索引 —— 已由 UniqueConstraint(uq_attachment_message)\n建唯一索引、依訊息查附件已可用(原本誤判為缺索引,查證後改為註解說明)。\n\n驗證:backend 142 passed(含 test_direct_conversations_batch / test_notifications_batch\n等價性測試);既有 /contacts、/notifications REST 測試亦綠。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e494df79f2fbd1a6cf6b1c4860e20705a02c1cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/e494df79f2fbd1a6cf6b1c4860e20705a02c1cdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/c6951da76e814a93608570d178734d0c1a670b2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"http