_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T18:38:23Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[mvp][perf][chat] 收訊息就地更新對話清單,免每則重抓 /conversations\n\n原本每收到一則 WS message 都呼叫 loadConversations() 重抓整份 /conversations\n(高頻訊息 = 每則一次 HTTP + 後端那串查詢)。改為:store 新增\napplyIncomingToConversations(message, currentUserId) 就地更新該對話的 last_message、\n未讀數(active 或自己送出不增,否則 +1,與伺服器語意一致)並置頂;只有當對話不在清單\n(新對話)時才退回 reloadConversations()。\n\nwsDispatch deps 加 currentUserId;ChatApp 接線。\n新增單元測試(store applyIncoming 4 案、dispatch 在清單/不在清單/自送 共 6 案),\nchat vitest 117 passed、tsc 乾淨、message-actions-ui E2E 綠。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70d2e7a561e7f3c18e1801f51358eaf3a48f68c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/70d2e7a561e7f3c18e1801f51358eaf3a48f68c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/6156d46b79fbc704f29260c77290e15876417350","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/6156d46b79fbc704f29260c77290e15876417350","node_id":"C_kwDOTDdM4toAKDYxNTZkNDZiNzlmYmM3MDRmMjkyNjBjNzcyOTBlMTU4NzY0MTczNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/8035840f1554e77ac83cc097301e230d71ca4fd2","sha":"8035840f1554e77ac83cc097301e230d71ca4fd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/8035840f1554e77ac83cc097301e230d71ca4fd2"}],"sha":"6156d46b79fbc704f29260c77290e15876417350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/6156d46b79fbc704f29260c77290e15876417350"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/8035840f1554e77ac83cc097301e230d71ca4fd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T18:28:12Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T18:28:12Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[mvp][perf][backend] list_messages 消除 per-message N+1:批次序列化\n\n原本 [serialize_message_out for m in messages] 每則各跑 ~3-6 個查詢\n(附件、表情、已讀數、回覆預覽、轉發來源),一頁 30 則 ≈ 90+ 查詢、limit 100 可達數百。\n新增 serialize_messages_out:一次撈本頁所有訊息的附件 / 表情 / 已讀數 / 被回覆訊息(+其附件)\n/ 轉發來源使用者 → 查詢數固定(~5)不隨訊息數成長。\n\n輸出與逐則 serialize_message_out 等價(表情分組順序本就不保證,正規化後比較)。\n驗證:backend 140 passed(含等價性測試 test_messages_batch);SQLite 與 Postgres\n雙環境皆等價(Postgres 以 rollback 驗不留痕)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84ebc8f76ae8d42bdb4b3bb40a3fa79445cbeb3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/84ebc8f76ae8d42bdb4b3bb40a3fa79445cbeb3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/8035840f1554e77ac83cc097301e230d71ca4fd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/8035840f1554e77ac83cc097301e230d71ca4fd2","node_id":"C_kwDOTDdM4toAKDgwMzU4NDBmMTU1NGU3N2FjODNjYzA5NzMwMWUyMzBkNzFjYTRmZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/801c0e779d9d63ba9ca3f81a0e460766bc27e8ab","sha":"801c0e779d9d63ba9ca3f81a0e460766bc27e8ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/801c0e779d9d63ba9ca3f81a0e460766bc27e8ab"}],"sha":"8035840f1554e77ac83cc097301e230d71ca4fd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/8035840f1554e77ac83cc097301e230d71ca4fd2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/801c0e779d9d63ba9ca3f81a0e460766bc27e8ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T17:59:33Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T17:59:33Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[chore][refactor][backend] 序列化下放新模組 + 移除函式內 schema import\n\n行為零變動(backend 139 passed)。\n\n#3 把 services/conversations.py(451 行的 grab-bag)的序列化抽到新檔\nservices/conversation_serializers.py:serialize_message_out / _conv_last_message_out /\nserialize_conversation_out / serialize_conversations_out。services/conversations.py\n回歸純查詢 helper;serializers 依賴它(單向,無循環)。importer(兩個 router、\nws/serializers、等價性測試)改指向新模組。\n\n#4 schemas 不 import 任何 app.* → 序列化在新模組用頂層 import(原本「函式內 import\n避免循環匯入」的註解已不成立);順手把 get_reaction_groups 的 ReactionGroupOut 上移到\n模組頂層、移除長期未使用的 and_ import。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e425557475363e6d3d24d417dc032f4ed2dc5ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/4e425557475363e6d3d24d417dc032f4ed2dc5ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/801c0e779d9d63ba9ca3f81a0e460766bc27e8ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/801c0e779d9d63ba9ca3f81a0e460766bc27e8ab","node_id":"C_kwDOTDdM4toAKDgwMWMwZTc3OWQ5ZDYzYmE5Y2EzZjgxYTBlNDYwNzY2YmMyN2U4YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/4cb5427160be33af43330659e1ecd5ea582641ea","sha":"4cb5427160be33af43330659e1ecd5ea582641ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/4cb5427160be33af43330659e1ecd5ea582641ea"}],"sha":"