eb-chat/commits/0c3d50b5d3812998ad15733ea8dba3fddd4881b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:31:52Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:31:52Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[mvp][refactor][chat] emoji-mart 改 React.lazy 動態載入,拆出主 bundle\n\nemoji-mart(react 包裝 + 大型 data JSON,~700KB)原本頂層 import,永遠進 chat\n主 bundle,但只有點「更多表情」才用。抽成 EmojiFullPicker.tsx 並以 React.lazy +\nSuspense 動態載入。\n\nbuild 後 emoji-mart 落在獨立 async chunk(EmojiFullPicker-*.js,693KB / gzip 123KB),\n不再拖累初始載入;只在第一次開啟完整選擇器時才抓。\n測試:對應 Thread 測試改為 await 等待 lazy 載入;chat vitest 111 passed、tsc 乾淨。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12acd1d9f5fae4eca7b16613012fb0e9ac6f1752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/12acd1d9f5fae4eca7b16613012fb0e9ac6f1752"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/0c3d50b5d3812998ad15733ea8dba3fddd4881b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/0c3d50b5d3812998ad15733ea8dba3fddd4881b7","node_id":"C_kwDOTDdM4toAKDBjM2Q1MGI1ZDM4MTI5OThhZDE1NzMzZWE4ZGJhM2ZkZGQ0ODgxYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/a50c594e4f695631da92c05301eacb747ad6d980","sha":"a50c594e4f695631da92c05301eacb747ad6d980","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/a50c594e4f695631da92c05301eacb747ad6d980"}],"sha":"0c3d50b5d3812998ad15733ea8dba3fddd4881b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/0c3d50b5d3812998ad15733ea8dba3fddd4881b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/a50c594e4f695631da92c05301eacb747ad6d980/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:27:48Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:27:48Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[mvp][feat][chat] 上傳失敗顯示錯誤訊息(不再靜默吞掉)\n\n原本 onUpload 把 413(過大)/415/網路錯誤都 catch 後回 null,使用者選了過大檔\n「完全沒反應」。改為:\n- onUpload 回傳 UploadResult 聯集({ok:true,attachment} | {ok:false,message}),\n  錯誤訊息取自後端 detail(ApiError.message,如「檔案過大（上限 10MB）」)。\n- Thread 在輸入列上方顯示紅色錯誤橫幅(role=\"alert\",可關閉),下次選檔自動清除。\n\n新增 Thread 元件測試:上傳失敗顯示錯誤、成功顯示待送附件名且無錯誤。\nchat vitest 111 passed、tsc 乾淨。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"278a1f69d61091055ac6b3622e3c88467cb07f03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/278a1f69d61091055ac6b3622e3c88467cb07f03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/a50c594e4f695631da92c05301eacb747ad6d980","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/a50c594e4f695631da92c05301eacb747ad6d980","node_id":"C_kwDOTDdM4toAKGE1MGM1OTRlNGY2OTU2MzFkYTkyYzA1MzAxZWFjYjc0N2FkNmQ5ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/1ec2e85f3c5c2b44e7d4ad510ee48baf687fff1e","sha":"1ec2e85f3c5c2b44e7d4ad510ee48baf687fff1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/1ec2e85f3c5c2b44e7d4ad510ee48baf687fff1e"}],"sha":"a50c594e4f695631da92c05301eacb747ad6d980","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/a50c594e4f695631da92c05301eacb747ad6d980"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/1ec2e85f3c5c2b44e7d4ad510ee48baf687fff1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:20:16Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:20:16Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[mvp][fix][backend] 上傳改分塊讀取,避免整檔載入記憶體(記憶體耗盡風險)\n\n原本 `data = await file.read()` 把整個檔案一次讀進記憶體後才檢查大小,惡意者上傳\n超大檔可在 413 之前就吃光記憶體。改為:\n- 先看 file.size(Content-Length)宣告大小,過大直接 413、連讀都不必。\n- 以 64KB 分塊讀取並累計,一超過 10MB 上限即中止,記憶體用量上限約為 10MB+一塊,\n  與實際檔案大小無關(也能擋宣告大小造假的情況)。\n\n行為不變:>10MB → 413、=10MB → 201、空檔 → 400。\n新增測試:邊界(恰好 10MB 可成功)、跨分塊 200KB 上傳下載位元完全相同(驗證重組正確)。\nbackend 137 passed。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opu