,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/82b17d01534371476127f4c4d9dfdbe0d5827e25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:43:00Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:43:00Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[chore][refactor][backend] WS/REST 訊息序列化收斂為單一真相\n\n行為零變動(backend 135 passed、message-actions-ui E2E 綠)。WS 端不再手組 dict,\n改為:services.serialize_message_out 組出 MessageOut → model_dump(mode=\"json\")。\n如此 WS 與 REST 的訊息外型永遠一致(uuid→str、datetime→tz-aware UTC ISO、reactions\nuser_ids→str、reply_to/forwarded_from 同形),改欄位只需動 schemas.MessageOut 一處,\n不再有「兩邊各維護一份、忘了同步」的風險(presence 那次 tz bug 即此類)。\n\n- serialize_message_out 加 read_count_value 參數(新訊息帶 0 省一次查詢,行為同舊 WS)\n- ws/serializers.py 64→17 行,移除手組 dict 與 _stringify_uuid_dict\n\n驗證:全套 WS 測試(test_ws / reply / forward / attachments / message_actions)斷言\npayload 欄位皆通過;message-actions-ui 於前端渲染 message_updated 也正確。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e7185493571cfbb2d18b7fdfa3f2a4272216118","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/7e7185493571cfbb2d18b7fdfa3f2a4272216118"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/82b17d01534371476127f4c4d9dfdbe0d5827e25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"