105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/5b4e7467fc44e30f13b36dc86af2d68b1dbbb4f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:29:52Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:29:52Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[chore][refactor][backend] 對話/訊息序列化下放 services;順手收斂成員 N+1\n\n行為零變動(backend 135 passed)。把 routers/conversations.py 的序列化邏輯移到\nservices/conversations.py:\n- serialize_conversation_out(取代 router 的 _build_conversation_out)\n- serialize_message_out(取代 list_messages 內聯組裝)\n\nrouter(378→308 行)只留路由與守門/WS 廣播;六個端點改呼叫 service。\n順手把 _build_conversation_out 內「逐一 db.get(User) 取成員」的 per-member N+1\n改成單次 select(...in_(member_ids)) 後依原順序還原 —— 輸出位元相同、查詢更省。\n(list_conversations 逐對話迴圈層級的 N+1 屬較大改動,留作後續。)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2a49d8644e920c76411aafa5c95e429ee870abd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/e2a49d8644e920c76411aafa5c95e429ee870abd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/5b4e7467fc44e30f13b36dc86af2d68b1dbbb4f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/foll