hub.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/c8e014be0be09692089b878829eac391711db0da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:21:52Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:21:52Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[chore][refactor][chat] ChatApp 抽出 wsDispatch 模組 + useMessageActions hook\n\n行為零變動。把 god component 的兩塊高內聚邏輯抽離:\n- wsDispatch.ts:server→client 訊息分派(switch)抽成純函式 dispatchServerMessage,\n  store 變更集中於此、副作用(reloadConversations/sendRead/handleCallSignal)由 deps 注入。\n  新增 wsDispatch.test.ts(8 測)—— ChatApp 原本無單元測試,此舉補上分派邏輯的覆蓋。\n- useMessageActions.ts:送出/重試/編輯/刪除/表情/還原/轉發/編輯歷史 集中成 hook,\n  以既有 stable wsSend 發訊(行為與原 socketRef.current?.send 等價)。\n\nChatApp.tsx 447→約 340 行,回歸「組裝 + 資料載入」角色;hook 順序不變。\n驗證:chat tsc 乾淨、vitest 109 passed(+8 新測)、message-actions-ui E2E 綠\n(真實 ChatApp 走 編輯/表情/刪除/還原 + ack/message/message_updated 分派)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53799f956cbad0b9fbc61060deeb63c0d5895d82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/53799f956cbad0b9fbc61060deeb63c0d5895d82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/c8e014be0be09692089b878829eac391711db0da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":