575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/47eb0fc238809ff5bb4324da753102eb9031c2e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:59:12Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:59:12Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[presence][feat][contracts] Contact/WS presence 型別 + store + 純函式\n\ncontracts:Contact 加 online/last_seen_at;ServerWsMessage 加 {type:''presence''}。\nchat/presence.ts 純函式:presenceFromContacts / applyPresence / formatLastSeen\n(剛剛 / N 分鐘前 / N 小時前 / M/D;null → null 讓 UI 顯示「離線」)。\nstore:presence map + setPresenceFromContacts / applyPresenceEvent,reset 一併清空。\n單元測試 9(presence)+ 2(store)新增,chat vitest 95 passed、tsc 乾淨。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f59005dd6125b19b947314f9648e72d79c4d4ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/2f59005dd6125b19b947314f9648e72d79c4d4ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/47eb0fc238809ff5bb4324da753102eb9031c2e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/47eb0fc238809ff5bb4324da753102eb9031c2e3","node_id":"C_kwDOTDdM4toAKDQ3ZWIwZmMyMzg4MDlmZjViYjQzMjRkYTc1MzEwMmViOTAzMWMyZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/0e781b4fd2e5e06c76b3e0b76df4f99ccb3cf557","sha":"0e781b4fd2e5e06c76b3e0b76df4f99ccb3cf557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/0e781b4fd2e5e06c76b3e0b76df4f99ccb3cf557"}],"sha":"47eb0fc238809ff5bb4324da753102eb9031c2e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/47eb0fc238809ff5bb4324da753102eb9031c2e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/0e781b4fd2e5e06c76b3e0b76df4f99ccb3cf557/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:53:29Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:53:29Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[presence][feat][ws] WS 廣播 presence + /contacts 帶 online/last_seen\n\n連線首條上線廣播 online、末條離線記 last_seen(記憶體)並廣播 offline;\nGET /contacts 每筆好友帶 online(manager.is_online)與 last_seen_at(manager.get_last_seen)。\n\n重要設計轉折:presence 全程不從 WS 生命週期寫 DB。實作發現在 starlette TestClient\n的關閉路徑中於 WS disconnect 開 DB session 會死結,且連線當下頻繁寫 DB 在整體測試下\n也會誘發 SQLite 死結。因 presence 本即 in-memory、單程序,last_seen 一併存\nConnectionManager;User.last_seen_at 欄位與 0010 遷移保留作未來耐久化掛勾。\nspec/plan/acceptance 已同步此決策與理由。\n\n既有 WS 測試改用 _recv() 略過新的 presence 廣播 frame;conftest 加 autouse fixture\n逐測重置 manager/presence 單例避免跨測試殘留連線卡死。backend 全測 135 passed。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2cec4e8f41def0f1a30e4b3e76ff0225ef8a0bf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/2cec4e8f41def0f1a30e4b3e76ff0225ef8a0bf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/0e781b4fd2e5e06c76b3e0b76df4f99ccb3cf557","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":