ithub.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/906fe0a5c00537d864b10218a53a13114192131a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T16:54:55Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T16:54:55Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[in-app-notifications][test][e2e] 通知 E2E(API+UI)+ 文件 + 驗收勾選\n\n- notifications-api.spec.ts(NB-01..14):reply/reaction/forward 觸發、在線推播、\n  未讀數/列表、不通知自己、權限(401/隔離/marked 0)、離線補齊。\n- notifications-ui.spec.ts(NUI):鈴鐺紅點 → 展開通知中心 → 點通知導向對話並清未讀。\n- message-actions-ui:加 test.describe.configure({retries:2})(dev StrictMode WS 時序\n  敏感,重試換新 page/WS 規避假性 flaky)。\n- README 追溯表 + progress.md + acceptance 勾選更新。\n- 全套 e2e 47 passed(Postgres 容器);backend pytest 120 / chat vitest 84 / 三 app tsc 乾淨。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a29ddefa4e37af597af8553d0ff185b78336e8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/7a29ddefa4e37af597af8553d0ff185b78336e8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/906fe0a5c00537d864b10218a53a13114192131a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login"