情、\n  刪除、還原鈕,驗畫面對 message_updated 廣播的渲染(內容更新+「已編輯」、\n  chip 高亮、佔位、還原回內容)。與 message-actions-api.spec.ts(純 WS)互補。\n- 健壯性:chat 的 send() 在 socket 未 OPEN 時靜默丟棄,且 edit/delete/react 無失敗\n  重送;dev + StrictMode 雙掛載讓 socket 短暫不穩(production 無此問題)。故以\n  retryAction 對每個動作「重做到 server 反映為止」(冪等守門),避免假性 flaky。\n- README 補 UI spec 與 dev WS 重試說明。\n- 全套 37 specs 綠(API+UI,Postgres 容器後端)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63df52198a4cb65f08d9411f7c5281a19d0cd6f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/63df52198a4cb65f08d9411f7c5281a19d0cd6f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/3b1f2d04bba132a27de8a1605cbc74d8b543a28c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/3b1f2d04bba132a27de8a1605cbc74d8b543a28c","node_id":"C_kwDOTDdM4toAKDNiMWYyZDA0YmJhMTMyYTI3ZGU4YTE2MDVjYmM3NGQ4YjU0M2EyOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/353a6f1e81dc76905a8fe7edb0445cf2db1d17a5","sha":"353a6f1e81dc76905a8fe7edb0445cf2db1d17a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/353a6f1e81dc76905a8fe7edb0445cf2db1d17a5"}],"sha":"3b1f2d04bba132a27de8a1605cbc74d8b543a28c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/3b1f2d04bba132a27de8a1605cbc74d8b543a28c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/353a6f1e81dc76905a8fe7edb0445cf2db1d17a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:31:41Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:31:41Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[chat][test][e2e] 訊息動作 + 通話訊號 E2E specs(REST+WS,無 UI)\n\n- message-actions-api.spec.ts(MA-01..11):編輯/刪除/還原/表情 toggle +\n  守門(forbidden/invalid_payload),MA-11 用持續監聽 WS 驗廣播給另一成員。\n  不自動化編輯/還原時限(需操弄時間,由 pytest 覆蓋)。\n- call-signaling-api.spec.ts(VC-01..07):call_offer/answer/ice/reject/hangup\n  轉送與 from 標記、非好友 forbidden、缺 to_user_id invalid_payload、\n  對端離線 call_unavailable。\n- helpers.ts 加 wsSendRaw(只送不等回應,供「對端才收到」的訊號轉送)。\n- README.md 補 MA / VC 追溯表。\n- 全套 36 specs 於 Postgres 容器後端綠(GM+MA+VC+reply/forward);\n  過程抓到並修掉一個 Postgres-only 排序 bug(見前一 commit)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd6bb108c1dc836f0fbd639d3ba1a77955647621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/trees/dd6bb108c1dc836f0fbd639d3ba1a77955647621"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/git/commits/353a6f1e81dc76905a8fe7edb0445cf2db1d17a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/353a6f1e81dc76905a8fe7edb0445cf2db1d17a5","node_id":"C_kwDOTDdM4toAKDM1M2E2ZjFlODFkYzc2OTA1YThmZTdlZGIwNDQ1Y2YyZGIxZDE3YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/newman0934/web-chat/commit/555fa23d0c45be44f4af0c4d11bb13c68b2768b9","sha":"555fa23d0c45be44f4af0c4d11bb13c68b2768b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/555fa23d0c45be44f4af0c4d11bb13c68b2768b9"}],"sha":"353a6f1e81dc76905a8fe7edb0445cf2db1d17a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/353a6f1e81dc76905a8fe7edb0445cf2db1d17a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20105961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/java5575","id":20105961,"login":"java5575","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA1OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/java5575","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/newman0934/web-chat/commits/555fa23d0c45be44f4af0c4d11bb13c68b2768b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:31:29Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:31:29Z","email":"newman0934@gmail.com","name":"caesar"},"message":"[mvp][fix][backend] conversations 清單排序改用 tz-aware 比較\n\nGET /conversations 在 Postgres 上 500:排序 key 對無訊息對話用 naive 的\ndatetime.min,卻和有訊息對話的 created_at 相比 —— Postgres 的 TIMESTAMPTZ\n回 tz-aware datetime,naive/aware 混排觸發\n\"can''t compare offset-naive and offset-aware datetimes\"。\nSQLite 回 naive 才一直沒踩到,由新加的 Postgres E2E(GM-06)抓出。\n改為排序 key 一律正規化成 aware(UTC),SQLite/Postgres 皆安全。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78a2a1073e52a2ceb527f67a82965cf2d50072a9","url":"https://api.