ttps://github.com/juicycleff","id":11243590,"login":"juicycleff","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjQzNTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/commits/1891f9b6f5dad417cdfe09f5720835b91413db9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:06:48Z","email":"rex.raphael@outlook.com","name":"Rex Raphael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:06:48Z","email":"rex.raphael@outlook.com","name":"Rex Raphael"},"message":"fix(plugin-analytics): reset mounted ref on remount so Operations works under StrictMode\n\nThe OperationsTab mount effect only set mounted=false on cleanup and never\nreset it to true on re-setup. Under React.StrictMode (dev) the setup→cleanup→\nsetup cycle left mounted.current stuck false, so every async response handler —\nincluding the finally''s setBusy(false) and setResult/setJob — became a no-op:\nthe tab hung ''busy'' with no result. Reset mounted=true in the effect body.\n\nVerified live against the admin-demo backend (reproject returned counts; banner\nnow renders). Adds a StrictMode regression test that fails without the fix.","tree":{"sha":"1bb705c85c5b3521aa8df80b86b209c63255c708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/git/trees/1bb705c85c5b3521aa8df80b86b209c63255c708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/git/commits/1891f9b6f5dad417cdfe09f5720835b91413db9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.github