/api.github.com/users/juicycleff/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juicycleff","id":11243590,"login":"juicycleff","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjQzNTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/commits/f406e538089e388c9ea43a2ca3335fbe97a56cee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T16:45:52Z","email":"rex.raphael@outlook.com","name":"Rex Raphael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T16:45:52Z","email":"rex.raphael@outlook.com","name":"Rex Raphael"},"message":"Merge feat/analytics-console: analytics console plugin (Plan B)\n\nAdds an Analytics plugin to the fabriq-admin console over the analytics adminapi:\n- @fabriq-ai/admin-sdk: analytics client methods + types (status/backfill/\n  reconcile/reproject/purge/jobs), verified against the Go handlers.\n- plugins/analytics: Freshness dashboard (per-tenant lag, tenants-behind,\n  worst-case), capability-gated Operations (backfill/reconcile, sync result +\n  fleet async job-poll) and Privacy (reproject/purge behind a typed-tenant-id\n  confirm) tabs. Read-only users (analytics.read) see Freshness; admins\n  (analytics.admin) get all three.\n- Registered in the host app.\nWhole-branch review fix: async fleet partial-failures now surface\njob.result.error instead of a flat ''complete''.","tree":{"sha":"e2127a1b3016775dd468a9fb2987a3357655fa76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/git/trees/e2127a1b3016775dd468a9fb2987a3357655fa76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fa