026-07-02T19:17:57Z","email":"rex.raphael@outlook.com","name":"Rex Raphael"},"message":"chore: rename npm scope @fabriq/* → @fabriq-ai/* + add npm release CI\n\nThe @fabriq org is taken on npm, so rename every workspace package and\ndependency reference to the @fabriq-ai scope (packages, plugins, apps,\nREADME, CSS imports) and regenerate pnpm-lock.yaml.\n\nBolt on a tag-driven lockstep npm release: pushing a vX.Y.Z tag stamps\nall publishable packages to that version and publishes them to the public\nnpm registry under @fabriq-ai, plus a dispatch wrapper to cut tags from\nthe Actions UI.","tree":{"sha":"217bd5b6dcc2ea2caa7a09e997fce3073f764864","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/git/trees/217bd5b6dcc2ea2caa7a09e997fce3073f764864"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/git/commits/87e04eda820c409dfc7d6837194cb642ee6035d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11243590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juicycleff","id":11243590,"login":"juicycleff","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjQzNTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xraph/fabriq-admin/com