"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/commits/d0d4f7d1f2256a99589da9133cca770107ad425e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:13:47Z","email":"rex.raphael@outlook.com","name":"Rex Raphael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:13:47Z","email":"rex.raphael@outlook.com","name":"Rex Raphael"},"message":"Merge feat/sidebar-07-restyle: @/ ui migration + ops-surface plugins + console polish\n\nBrings the fabriq-admin console to its full interactive state: the @/\nui-source layout migration, the telemetry/events/commands/projections/cache\nops-surface plugins, the schema-driven DataGrid entity browser with\nreference/date pickers and infinite scroll, shared Combobox/confirm/portal\ntheming, and the build+test coherence work. Whole monorepo builds (tsc +\nvite) and all 414 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"b10d05e1c3908fb985d5d87503bdcd99d4b68b36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/git/trees/b10d05e1c3908fb985d5d87503bdcd99d4b68b36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/git/commits/d0d4f7d1f2256a99589da9133cca770107ad425e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11243590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juicycleff","id":11243590,"login":"juicycleff","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjQzNTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xraph/fabriq-admin/commit/d0d4f7d1f2256a99589da9133cca770107ad425e","node_id":"C_kwDOTDf5PNoAKGQwZDRmN2QxZjIyNTZhOTk1ODlkYTkxMzNjY2E3NzAxMDdhZDQyNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xraph/fabriq-admin/commit/43213ed7664acbb4650a841ff539c96627322259","sha":"43213ed7664acbb4650a841ff539c96627322259","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/commits/43213ed7664acbb4650a841ff539c96627322259"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/xraph/fabriq-admin/commit/a6c8fd17c30e779f5e9fa4bb9e9e1e9430020080","sha":"a6c8fd17c30e779f5e9fa4bb9e9e1e9430020080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/commits/a6c8fd17c30e779f5e9fa4bb9e9e1e9430020080"}],"sha":"d0d4f7d1f2256a99589da9133cca770107ad425e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/commits/d0d4f7d1f2256a99589da9133cca770107ad425e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11243590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juicycleff","id":11243590,"login":"juicycleff","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjQzNTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/commits/a6c8fd17c30e779f5e9fa4bb9e9e1e9430020080/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:13:21Z","email":"rex.raphael@outlook.com","name":"Rex Raphael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:13:36Z","email":"rex.raphael@outlook.com","name":"Rex Raphael"},"message":"feat(admin): @/ ui-source migration + ops-surface plugins + build/test coherence\n\nConsolidates the fabriq-admin console work on this branch:\n\nUI package migration\n- Move packages/ui components under src/ and adopt the shadcn \"@/…\" import\n  convention for ui-internal modules.\n- Resolve \"@\" to packages/ui/src everywhere the source is consumed: a shared\n  ${configDir}-anchored tsconfig path, plus Vite/Vitest aliases in host,\n  remote-example, ui, and every plugin. Re-export ButtonProps/BadgeProps from\n  the moved components so the public API is intact.\n\nFeatures\n- New ops-surface plugins: telemetry, events, commands, projections, cache.\n- Entity browser: schema-driven reui DataGrid, wider layout, reference-field\n  combobox pickers + shadcn date/datetime pickers, infinite-scroll list.\n- Shared shadcn Combobox EntityTypeCombobox, AlertDialog-based confirm(),\n  library-wide portal-container theming fix, tenant switcher.\n\nFixes surfaced once the vitest \"@\" alias let the full suite run again\n- Search/graph/spatial tests: target the operation request, not raw call\n  order (the type combobox now fetches /entities/types on mount).\n- Distill: correct the test''s node-path matching (colons kept, not encoded)\n  and guard the row against an empty children response.\n- Files: give the folder breadcrumb a distinct landmark label.\n- Entity list: re-run the infinite-scroll effect once the sentinel mounts\n  (real bug — the observer never attached), with a jsdom IO polyfill.\n\nWhole monorepo builds (tsc + vite) and all 414 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"b10d05e1c3908fb985d5d87503bdcd99d4b68b36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/git/trees/b10d05e1c3908fb985d5d87503bdcd99d4b68b36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/git/commits/a6c8fd17c30e779f5e9fa4bb9e9e1e9430020080","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11243590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juicycleff","id":11243590,"login":"juicycleff","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjQzNTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juicycleff","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xraph/fabriq-admin/commit/a6c8fd17c30e779f5e9fa4bb9e9e1e9430020080","node_id":"C_kwDOTDf5PNoAKGE2YzhmZDE3YzMwZTc3OWY1ZTlmYTRiYjllOWUxZTk0MzAwMjAwODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xraph/fabriq-admin/commit/c96144b37ed57c3525d86bafed5c38ed0e178ca2","sha":"c96144b37ed57c3525d86bafed5c38ed0e178ca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xraph/fabriq-admin/commits/c96144b37ed57c3525d86bafed5c38ed0e178ca2"}],"sha":"a