pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/9be0cdb6f04743564b385275bb4932882fd6a3b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:49:52Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:49:52Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"message":"fix: point local aws-exports.js at the real staging Cognito/AppSync backend\n\nLocal ng serve/build was still using the empty placeholder, so any\nAuth call failed with \"Auth UserPool not configured\" - there''s no\nseparate \"dev\" backend provisioned (no local AWS credentials to push\none). Use the real staging resource ids instead, since they now exist\nafter the staging deploy actually provisioned them.\n\nAlso: ng serve host-app resolves the shared-utils import through\ndist/shared-utils (the tsconfig path mapping), which is a separately\nbuilt artifact - editing shared-utils source doesn''t take effect for\nserve until `ng build shared-utils` runs again and the dev server is\nrestarted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b94dff2435a9f197ae55850b177d3583d1841e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/trees/9b94dff2435a9f197ae55850b177d3583d1841e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/commits/9be0cdb6f04743564b385275bb4932882fd6a3b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/9be0cdb6f04743564b385275bb4932882fd6a3b4","node_id":"C_kwDOTDpnS9oAKDliZTBjZGI2ZjA0NzQzNTY0YjM4NTI3NWJiNDkzMjg4MmZkNmEzYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/2fdae2575ef79d2354e92eb22e3ca105291c6520","sha":"2fdae2575ef79d2354e92eb22e3ca105291c6520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/2fdae2575ef79d2354e92eb22e3ca105291c6520"}],"sha":"9be0cdb6f04743564b385275bb4932882fd6a3b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/9be0cdb6f04743564b385275bb4932882fd6a3b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/2fdae2575ef79d2354e92eb22e3ca105291c6520/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:25:29Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:25:29Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"message":"fix: seed amplify-meta.json with pending auth/api categories before push\n\nRoot cause found: amplify push computes its diff from amplify-meta.json,\nnot backend-config.json. amplify-meta.json is gitignored and gets fully\nregenerated by amplify pull from whatever the cloud actually has\ndeployed for that environment - it has no way to know auth/api should\nexist if they were only ever `amplify add`-ed locally and never\nactually pushed anywhere. Restoring backend-config.json from git (the\nprevious fix) had no effect because amplify publish does its own\ninternal re-pull before computing its status table, and that table\nnever mentioned auth/api at all - confirmed by dumping amplify-meta.json\nin CI, which had only \"providers\" and \"hosting\".\n\namplify/backend/.pending-meta-seed.json is a snapshot of the auth/api\nentries amplify-meta.json had locally right after `amplify add`,\nbefore any real push (no environment-specific resource IDs, since\nnothing was deployed yet). scripts/seed-amplify-meta.mjs merges any\ncategory from that seed that''s missing from the freshly pulled\namplify-meta.json, so push has something to actually create. Once a\nreal push succeeds, future pulls will see the category as already\ndeployed and the seed becomes a no-op for that environment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33707e756a50328080377899e757bef2fc1dee95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/trees/33707e756a50328080377899e757bef2fc1dee95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/commits/2fdae2575ef79d2354e92eb22e3ca105291c6520","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/2fdae2575ef79d2354e92eb22e3ca105291c6520","node_id":"C_kwDOTDpnS9oAKDJmZGFlMjU3NWVmNzlkMjM1NGU5MmViMjJlM2NhMTA1MjkxYzY1MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/3b1eef8bba6b903fb6a9d7d6527dd44bb8f01f27","sha":"3b1eef8bba6b903fb6a9d7d6527dd44bb8f01f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/3b1eef8bba6b903fb6a9d7d6527dd44bb8f01f27"}],"sha":"2fdae2575ef79d2354e92eb22e3ca105291c6520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/2fdae2575ef79d2354e92eb22e3ca105291c6520"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/3b1eef8bba6b903fb6a9d7d6527dd44bb8f01f27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:16:36Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:16:36Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"message":"debug: split amplify push from publish, dump meta files for diagnosis\n\nRestoring backend-config.json from git after amplify pull had no\neffect - the staging status table still only showed Hosting after the\nfix. Suspect amplify publish does its own internal re-pull/sync before\ncomputing its diff, undoing the restore. Split push out as its own\nexplicit step and dump amplify-meta.json before/after to see what the\nCLI actually has in hand when it decides there''s nothing to deploy for\nauth/api.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c0b7ab66e65aebc14230db4f0a5b3f77fc3479c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/trees/8c0b7ab66e65aebc14230db4f0a5b3f77fc3479c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/commits/3b1eef8bba6b903fb6a9d7d6527dd44bb8f01f27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/3b1eef8bba6b903fb6a9d7d6527dd44bb8f01f27","node_id":"C_kwDOTDpnS9oAKDNiMWVlZjhiYmE2YjkwM2ZiNmE5ZDdkNjUyN2RkNDRiYjhmMDFmMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/25946a528402bd6784cf033491a01a36fecddd2e","sha":"25946a528402bd6784cf033491a01a36fecddd2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/25946a528402bd6784cf033491a01a36fecddd2e"}],"sha":"3b1eef8bba6b903fb6a9d7d6527dd44bb8f01f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/3b1eef8bba6b903fb6a9d7d6527dd44bb8f01f27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/25946a528402bd6784cf033491a01a36fecddd2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:08:20Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T17:08:20Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"message":"fix: restore backend-config.json/auth/api after amplify pull\n\namplify pull resets backend-config.json and category folders to match\nwhatever this specific environment already has deployed in the cloud,\nsilently dropping categories that were only ever added locally/in git\nbut never pushed for that environment. The staging deploy status table\nshowed only Hosting, with auth/api missing entirely - publish never\neven saw them. Restore the committed desired state from git right\nafter pull so newly added categories actually get included.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b571c5c1b73d3ab6258155791ae1e57505c27dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/trees/3b571c5c1b73d3ab6258155791ae1e57505c27dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/commits/25946a528402bd6784cf033491a01a36fecddd2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/25946a528402bd6784cf033491a01a36fecddd2e","node_id":"C_kwDOTDpnS9oAKDI1OTQ2YTUyODQwMmJkNjc4NGNmMDMzNDkxYTAxYTM2ZmVjZGRkMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/e72f1fa0e6595dc1c3f5b15c4bfa259a2d678b62","sha":"e72f1fa0e6595dc1c3f5b15c4bfa259a2d678b62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/e72f1fa0e6595dc1c3f5b15c4bfa259a2d678b62"}],"sha":"25946a528402bd6784cf033491a01a36fecddd2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/25946a528402bd6784cf033491a01a36fecddd2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/e72f1fa0e6595dc1c3f5b15c4bfa259a2d678b62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T16:55:03Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T16:55:03Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"message":"feat: require sign-in to use the app, persist subscriptions per-user\n\nAdds AWS Cognito auth (email sign-in) and an AppSync GraphQL API\n(PodcastSubscription, owner-scoped via @auth(rules:[{allow:owner}]))\nbacked by DynamoDB, replacing the old single-device localStorage\nsubscriptions store.\n\n- amplify add auth / add api scaffolding (Cognito + AppSync, both\n  provisioned for real the first time this lands in CI)\n- shared-utils: AuthService (signIn/signUp/confirmSignUp/signOut,\n  isAuthenticated/currentUserEmail signals, a `ready` promise that\n  resolves after the first session check so route guards don''t redirect\n  before we know if a session is already persisted)\n- shared-utils: SubscriptionsService now loads/persists subscriptions\n  via GraphQL, gated on AuthService.isAuthenticated, with optimistic\n  updates that revert on failure\n- new `login` remote: full-page, host-app-gated sign-in/sign-up/confirm\n  screen (not a modal) - the only route reachable while signed out\n- host-app: authGuard/guestGuard make every other route redirect to\n  /login when signed out (and /login redirect to / when already signed\n  in); navbar/footer/audio-player chrome is hidden entirely on /login\n- aws-exports.js is committed as a placeholder (empty resource ids) so\n  local/CI builds work before an environment is provisioned; amplify\n  push/publish overwrites it with real values per environment\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6ea40f128382aeb2d02ffdedc56a94292c31e2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/trees/b6ea40f128382aeb2d02ffdedc56a94292c31e2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/commits/e72f1fa0e6595dc1c3f5b15c4bfa259a2d678b62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs"