24ea137574920361/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T08:13:04Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T08:13:04Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"message":"fix: write ~/.aws/credentials for Amplify CLI in CI\n\nAmplify Gen1 CLI''s configuration check doesn''t reliably recognize\ncredentials supplied only via env vars (as configure-aws-credentials\nsets them), failing with \"Invalid configuration settings!\" / \"Current\nenvironment cannot be determined.\" Writing an explicit credentials\nfile from the same env vars resolves it.","tree":{"sha":"96aa6c59aa0e8d5327b263c9463ec390b0f82ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/trees/96aa6c59aa0e8d5327b263c9463ec390b0f82ece"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/commits/47b052538cd34b502af8abf724ea137574920361","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/47b052538cd34b502af8abf724ea137574920361","node_id":"C_kwDOTDpnS9oAKDQ3YjA1MjUzOGNkMzRiNTAyYWY4YWJmNzI0ZWExMzc1NzQ5MjAzNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/9a9ec8d587b41f6b65ca379911cfb07140173cae","sha":"9a9ec8d587b41f6b65ca379911cfb07140173cae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/9a9ec8d587b41f6b65ca379911cfb07140173cae"}],"sha":"47b052538cd34b502af8abf724ea137574920361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/47b052538cd34b502af8abf724ea137574920361"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/9a9ec8d587b41f6b65ca379911cfb07140173cae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T08:08:51Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T08:08:51Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"message":"fix: build shared-utils before host-app, fix CI permissions/notify\n\n- npm run build only built host-app, but its tsconfig path mapping\n  points to dist/shared-utils, which only exists locally because it\n  was built once and never cleaned. Build shared-utils first.\n- test.yml lacked checks:write, so the Report results step 403''d\n  trying to create a check run.\n- amplify-deploy.yml''s notify step used context.issue.number, which\n  is always undefined on push-triggered runs (this workflow has no\n  PR context), causing every run''s final step to fail regardless of\n  deploy outcome. Switch to a commit comment instead.","tree":{"sha":"956b3e71fadca9dc67c9333bfa95aa4862d21bf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/trees/956b3e71fadca9dc67c9333bfa95aa4862d21bf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/git/commits/9a9ec8d587b41f6b65ca379911cfb07140173cae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/9a9ec8d587b41f6b65ca379911cfb07140173cae","node_id":"C_kwDOTDpnS9oAKDlhOWVjOGQ1ODdiNDFmNmI2NWNhMzc5OTExY2ZiMDcxNDAxNzNjYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commit/bf69d9506e6a651db1dd69a2133882487919852a","sha":"bf69d9506e6a651db1dd69a2133882487919852a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/bf69d9506e6a651db1dd69a2133882487919852a"}],"sha":"9a9ec8d587b41f6b65ca379911cfb07140173cae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/9a9ec8d587b41f6b65ca379911cfb07140173cae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-podcasts/commits/bf69d9506e6a651db1dd69a2133882487919852a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T08:05:12Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"Milton Jones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T08:05:12Z","email":"miltone