eat(admin-user): upload the user avatar through a host-injected drive service\n\nThe user admin workspace accepts an optional avatar service from its\nhost instead of touching the drive SDK itself: with one injected it\nrenders the stored avatar and an upload button (editing uploads\nimmediately against the existing user id; creating parks the picked\nfile and uploads after createUser returns, then attaches the returned\nresource with a follow-up update). Drive-backed previews resolve through\nthe injected service; without a host service the field degrades to the\nplain delivery-URL input, so existing hosts keep working.\n\nThe controller maps the avatar media-resource snapshot object from user\nresponses and rides the resource back on users.create / users.update as\nthe avatar object, alongside the legacy avatarUrl string form.","tree":{"sha":"1db5e07cceb788197e07077da86c7b60fd95aded","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/1db5e07cceb788197e07077da86c7b60fd95aded"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/6a1d66fc8dc4a23d90b9bbe4e903d472023a4ff3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwor