},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T13:04:47Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"feat(admin-user): collect avatar, gender, birth date, country, and initial password in the user directory\n\nBackend-admin users.create / users.update now accept the operator-managed\nprofile attributes the admin console collects:\n\n- avatar: stored as the existing avatar_resource_snapshot media-resource\n  JSON; the wire accepts an avatar object or a plain avatarUrl string\n  (<=128KiB snapshot) and responses carry both avatar and the derived\n  avatarUrl\n- gender (male|female|unknown), birth_date (YYYY-MM-DD), country\n  (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2): new columns from migration 0019 with the baseline\n  kept in sync; users.list / users.retrieve return them\n- initialPassword (8-64 chars, blank leaves it untouched): hashed with\n  argon2 into iam_credential inside the create transaction and stamped as\n  password_changed_at, so an operator can provision or reset a password\n\nThe admin-user workspace drawer grows avatar preview, gender/country\nselectors (full ISO 3166-1 option table, zh/en labels), date input, and a\npassword field with policy hint; create requires username + displayName to\nmatch the backend contract. Covered by a postgres create/update/list\nroundtrip integration test and extended controller unit tests.","tree":{"sha":"90fb85cd499f2706cc532c09c9c8b4dace79aa09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/90fb85cd499f2706cc532c09c9c8b4dace79aa09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/d8b1199b2688c65253f9aaa1aac93e17ab7544ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api