page on Flutter and the mini program\n\nFlutter (authored sdkwork_iam_flutter_mobile_user): IamFlutterMobileUserMeScreen\nplus a framework-independent controller mirroring the headless core contract —\ninjected profile/session/sign-out collaborators, bounded awaits, synchronous\nlistener notifications, canonical iam.userCenter.me.* message keys and screen\nids, sign-out that clears every sensitive field, and Material ColorScheme +\nSdkworkDesignTokens styling with loading/error/retry states. Also fix a\npre-existing compile break: commons SdkworkScaffold referenced\nSdkworkLoadingView without importing it, which failed flutter test compilation\nfor every capability package.\n\nMini program (sdkwork-iam-mp-user-center, now declared pre-existing in the\nsurface generator so authored capability code survives materialization):\ncreateIamMpUserCenterMePage binds @sdkwork/iam-user-center-core to a WeChat\npage via an injected setData sink, maps controller state to WXML data,\ndispatches data-item-id tap intents, and ships zh-CN/en-US Me fragments. Root\nvitest now includes mini-program package tests.\n\nRegression: workspace vitest re-run — all packages I own pass; the 8\npre-existing failures (iam-contracts/service/PC page_size spelling) are\nindependent of this diff (28/28 files in the prior commit were new paths).","tree":{"sha":"04adbdd8b78ae95b3b9aee2be5610438b70a29a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/04adbdd8b78ae95b3b9aee2be5610438b70a29a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/7be73bc280e8974d29f324e9d2387283d284cd86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai