os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/00b297af886e18a9336ea1408da68bb46a11e8b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:43:46Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:43:46Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"feat(iam-h5): ship the slot-based Me page over a shared user-center core\n\nAdd @sdkwork/iam-user-center-core, the cross-architecture headless core for\nthe mobile user-center (Me) page: view models, canonical menu model with\ni18n message keys, the dual-mode --sdk-comp-iam-me-* theme-token contract\nwith sdkwork/midnight/paper presets, and a bounded, abort-aware page state\ncontroller over an injected SdkworkIamService with sensitive-state clearing\non sign-out.\n\nLand the React implementation in the authored @sdkwork/iam-h5-user package:\nSdkworkIamH5UserCenterMeScreen renders nine appearance slots (Page, Header,\nHero, ContextCard, Menu+MenuItem, Actions, States, Footer), each with a\ntoken-driven default renderer, plus the controller binding hook, idempotent\nstyle injection, zh-CN/en-US fragments, and Testing Library coverage for\nloading/ready/error/retry, sign-out, navigation intents, slot replacement,\nand zh-CN localization.\n\nRegister the new package in the pnpm workspace sibling block and add the\ntheme conformance contract links to the user spec.","tree":{"sha":"5ada9d38ad3cd99b8fcd5e173ca9b75014f35dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/5ada9d38ad3cd99b8fcd5e173ca9b75014f35dcc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/00b297af886e18a9336ea1408da68bb46a11e8b5","verification":{"payload