wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/8f27ff6facd4d6e2c52e4f085c915a982b360950/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:50:50Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:50:50Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"feat(iam): echo the stored cloud-account credential in the edit form\n\nThe edit form followed the identity shape for nothing: switching it drew no\nfields, and the stored credential was invisible, so editing an account was a\nrename plus a blind rotation.\n\nThe read-back is a new reveal route on the backend-account surface\n(GET .../provider_accounts/{id}/credentials/reveal, operation\nproviderAccounts.credentials.reveal). It opens the same active credential\nresolution hands a consumer, seeds the edit form field by field, and answers\nconfigured:false for an account with nothing stored yet. It is fenced three\nways: a dedicated iam.provider_credentials.reveal permission no read-only\nwildcard matches (app_user holds it for self-management), the same account\nvisibility walk the single read applies, and an audit record per open with a\nno-store response header.\n\nThe edit form now derives its credential fields from the selected identity\nshape exactly as the register form does, echoes the revealed values in\nplaintext, and rotates only what changed: an untouched secret is not re-sent,\na shape switch that changes the credential kind revokes the slot it replaced,\nand emptied fields revoke outright. Console and admin render the same shared\nworkspace, so both surfaces get the fix.\n\nRoute manifest, OpenAPI authority, and the TypeScript backend SDK are\nregenerated through the materializer; ports, adapter, and the iam-service\nfacade carry the new operation.","tree":{"sha":"8113ea953ea0aa56a4ac7f5c59eef6b8d51cd697","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/8113ea953ea0aa56a4ac7f5c59eef6b8d51cd697"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/8f27ff6facd4d6e2c52e4f085c915a982b360950","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/8f27ff6facd4d6e2c52e4f085c915a982b360950","node_id":"C_kwDOTDsd2doAKDhmMjdmZjZmYWNkNGQ2ZTJjNTJlNGYwODVjOTE1YTk4MmIzNjA5NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/94951214ae7a48860d0482af35f978cf63b7c0c1","sha":"94951214ae7a48860d0482af35f978cf63b7c0c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/94951214ae7a48860d0482af35f978cf63b7c0c1"}],"sha":"8f27ff6facd4d6e2c52e4f085c915a982b360950","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/8f27ff6facd4d6e2c52e4f085c915a982b360950"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/94951214ae7a48860d0482af35f978cf63b7c0c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T01:28:37Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T01:28:37Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"chore: update iam cloud account console","tree":{"sha":"2642b6582b8d7915e1b5c2dbc78b945d93651d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/2642b6582b8d7915e1b5c2dbc78b945d93651d78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/94951214ae7a48860d0482af35f978cf63b7c0c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/94951214ae7a48860d0482af35f978cf63b7c0c1","node_id":"C_kwDOTDsd2doAKDk0OTUxMjE0YWU3YTQ4ODYwZDA0ODJhZjM1Zjk3OGNmNjNiN2MwYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/4d358bc0c3c0d969c5683e8b0d80d41a212301cd","sha":"4d358bc0c3c0d969c5683e8b0d80d41a212301cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/4d358bc0c3c0d969c5683e8b0d80d41a212301cd"}],"sha":"94951214ae7a48860d0482af35f978cf63b7c0c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/94951214ae7a48860d0482af35f978cf63b7c0c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/4d358bc0c3c0d969c5683e8b0d80d41a212301cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:40:33Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:40:33Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"test(iam): end-to-end coverage for the desktop browser-login redeem leg\n\nAdds oauth_desktop_session_integration: credential-entry login → public-\nclient authorize (PKCE S256, sdkwork-iam://auth/callback deep-link\nredirect) → authorization completion → POST /app/v3/api/oauth/desktop_sessions\nredeems the code for a standard dual-token session, with single-use-code\nand PKCE-mismatch negative cases. Registered in the standard contract\nrunner.\n\nFixes uncovered while rooting the suite''s login-leg failure on a fresh\ndatabase (run against an isolated canonical sdkwork_ai_test_* database):\n\n- the suite now declares its own test environment: the credential-entry\n  login leg authenticates with the unsigned jwt_fixtures tokens, which the\n  framework accepts only in an explicitly test/dev deployment\n- the fixture provisions the tenant''s platform application\n  (app_<tenant>) through ensure_platform_tenant_application — the login\n  leg resolves its runtime app scope through it and nothing else seeds it\n- login failures now include the response body in the assertion message\n- tracing-subscriber joins the dev-dependencies for test log visibility\n\nKnown product issue surfaced (out of scope, documented in the fixtures):\npersonal-login sessions persist organization_id ''0'', and\niam_session_org_fk requires that (tenant_id, ''0'') in iam_organization —\nbut iam_organization''s global id primary key lets only one tenant own the\nsentinel row, so first-time personal login for any other tenant fails on\na fresh database. The desktop fixture therefore runs against the\nbootstrapped default tenant.","tree":{"sha":"3be84ee78fcb1db959105bc65e8b1865885f38a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/3be84ee78fcb1db959105bc65e8b1865885f38a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/4d358bc0c3c0d969c5683e8b0d80d41a212301cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/4d358bc0c3c0d969c5683e8b0d80d41a212301cd","node_id":"C_kwDOTDsd2doAKDRkMzU4YmMwYzNjMGQ5NjljNTY4M2U4YjBkODBkNDFhMjEyMzAxY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/bc3a0443733fcd49eeac85717757def001627373","sha":"bc3a0443733fcd49eeac85717757def001627373","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/bc3a0443733fcd49eeac85717757def001627373"}],"sha":"4d358bc0c3c0d969c5683e8b0d80d41a212301cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/4d358bc0c3c0d969c5683e8b0d80d41a212301cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/bc3a0443733fcd49eeac85717757def001627373/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T07:15:24Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T07:15:24Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"fix(iam): stop the oauth auto-complete from retrying on persistent failure\n\nThe auto-complete effect re-runs whenever completeAuthFlow''s identity\nchanges (every render). Resetting the guard on failure turned a\ndeterministically failing completion (e.g. an expired server-side state)\ninto an unbounded retry loop with toast spam on unrelated re-renders. The\nguard now holds for the mount: one auto-attempt, failure surfaced as a\ntoast, manual sign-in through the form still completes the authorization\nthrough the normal flow. Regression test asserts exactly one attempt.","tree":{"sha":"ab88804bc9357512ca5685740bc785ec0f2a4fbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/ab88804bc9357512ca5685740bc785ec0f2a4fbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/bc3a0443733fcd49eeac85717757def001627373","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/bc3a0443733fcd49eeac85717757def001627373","node_id":"C_kwDOTDsd2doAKGJjM2EwNDQzNzMzZmNkNDllZWFjODU3MTc3NTdkZWYwMDE2MjczNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/a8f691663096085d14859e37ee02d6e459750ea4","sha":"a8f691663096085d14859e37ee02d6e459750ea4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/a8f691663096085d14859e37ee02d6e459750ea4"}],"sha":"bc3a0443733fcd49eeac85717757def001627373","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/bc3a0443733fcd49eeac85717757def001627373"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/a8f691663096085d14859e37ee02d6e459750ea4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:17:07Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:17:07Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"docs(iam): document desktop auth surface model and dev-mode protocol registration\n\n- auth-pc-react README: desktop browser-login entry, the hosted hand-off\n  page, and the callback-page authorization completion in the surface model\n- DESKTOP_BROWSER_LOGIN.md: Electron unpackaged-dev protocol registration\n  differences (Windows setAsDefaultProtocolClient path/args, macOS\n  CFBundleURLTypes)","tree":{"sha":"a8d980d3f684edffd37d6a4a67612dd9155f4d7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/a8d980d3f684edffd37d6a4a67612dd9155f4d7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/a8f691663096085d14859e37ee02d6e459750ea4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/a8f691663096085d14859e37ee02d6e459750ea4","node_id":"C_kwDOTDsd2doAKGE4ZjY5MTY2MzA5NjA4NWQxNDg1OWUzN2VlMDJkNmU0NTk3NTBlYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/ea7b52f4de9f26cd8ec67207d45442df6410a93b","sha":"ea7b52f4de9f26cd8ec67207d45442df6410a93b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/ea7b52f4de9f26cd8ec67207d45442df6410a93b"}],"sha":"a8f691663096085d14859e37ee02d6e459750ea4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/a8f691663096085d14859e37ee02d6e459750ea4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/ea7b52f4de9f26cd8ec67207d45442df6410a93b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:06:13Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:06:13Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"fix(iam): close desktop hand-off gaps and document per-host integration\n\nRegression round over the desktop browser-login feature:\n\n- third-party provider logins started during a desktop authorization now\n  complete the pending authorization and still hand off: the callback URI\n  carries oauthAuthorizationStateId through the provider round-trip, and\n  AuthOAuthCallbackPage suppresses the authenticated Navigate until the\n  pending authorization completes and the deep-link hand-off runs\n- the Electron shellOpen bridge enforces a scheme allowlist (default:\n  https + the app''s own deep-link scheme) before handing URLs to the OS\n- DESKTOP_BROWSER_LOGIN.md now documents integration flows per host\n  (Electron main/preload/renderer, Tauri config + plugins, browser\n  fallback, custom hosts), all interaction sequences (fresh login,\n  already-signed-in browser, provider path, cold start, cancel, failures),\n  and an integration checklist for new desktop applications","tree":{"sha":"f844b330363d9ef581ff7d31640bfaea1cc27f42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/f844b330363d9ef581ff7d31640bfaea1cc27f42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/ea7b52f4de9f26cd8ec67207d45442df6410a93b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/ea7b52f4de9f26cd8ec67207d45442df6410a93b","node_id":"C_kwDOTDsd2doAKGVhN2I1MmY0ZGU5ZjI2Y2Q4ZWM2NzIwN2Q0NTQ0MmRmNjQxMGE5M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/28bdb35ae025197413c455df362e4f60229bfed7","sha":"28bdb35ae025197413c455df362e4f60229bfed7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/28bdb35ae025197413c455df362e4f60229bfed7"}],"sha":"ea7b52f4de9f26cd8ec67207d45442df6410a93b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/ea7b52f4de9f26cd8ec67207d45442df6410a93b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/28bdb35ae025197413c455df362e4f60229bfed7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:40:09Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:40:09Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"fix(iam): harden desktop browser-login hand-off and add the standard runtime entry\n\nRegression pass over the desktop browser-login flow:\n\n- resolveAuthAccess exempts the hosted desktop hand-off page\n  (/auth/desktop/launch) from the authenticated-user bounce: the user is\n  always authenticated in the browser when they land there, so routing them\n  home silently dropped the deep-link hand-off. All other auth routes keep\n  redirecting away.\n- AuthPage auto-completes an oauthAuthorizationStateId authorization when\n  the browser user is already authenticated instead of showing the login\n  form with no action.\n- SdkworkIamDesktopAuthController gains cancelLogin() (abandon a waiting\n  flow, keep the controller usable — dispose() remains final teardown);\n  the auth-page binding no longer destroys the controller on cancel.\n- A failed session exchange resets the flow and leaves the waiting state\n  (the authorization code is single-use; retrying the same code can never\n  succeed).\n- New standard integration entry createSdkworkIamDesktopAuthRuntime:\n  one call binds oauth.desktopSessions.create, deep-link dispatch, cold-start\n  completion, and session delivery for any desktop application;\n  deriveSdkworkDesktopRedirectUri mirrors the Rust scheme rules.\n- Tests: access exemption, cancel-and-retry, exchange-failure reset,\n  runtime factory flows (28 in iam-desktop-auth, 10 in auth-pc-react).\n- Design doc: standard integration section and auth-surface semantics.","tree":{"sha":"6ff2c360933d503be974b5569193061f7387da0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/6ff2c360933d503be974b5569193061f7387da0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/28bdb35ae025197413c455df362e4f60229bfed7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/28bdb35ae025197413c455df362e4f60229bfed7","node_id":"C_kwDOTDsd2doAKDI4YmRiMzVhZTAyNTE5NzQxM2M0NTVkZjM2MmU0ZjYwMjI5YmZlZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/693efbfa9059648a2bf962d9b13d4470fb0f24ed","sha":"693efbfa9059648a2bf962d9b13d4470fb0f24ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/693efbfa9059648a2bf962d9b13d4470fb0f24ed"}],"sha":"28bdb35ae025197413c455df362e4f60229bfed7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/28bdb35ae025197413c455df362e4f60229bfed7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/693efbfa9059648a2bf962d9b13d4470fb0f24ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:18:00Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:18:00Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"feat(iam): add desktop browser-login flow with deep-link hand-off\n\nDesktop apps (Electron/Tauri) log in through the system browser instead of\nrendering their own credentials UI, following RFC 8252 + PKCE S256:\n\n- web-adapter: accept registered custom-scheme and RFC 8252 loopback\n  redirect URIs (port-flexible), classify redirect surface web/desktop,\n  and redeem authorization codes into a validated user context\n  (redeem_authorization_code_session_context) with correct query appending\n- app-api: POST /app/v3/api/oauth/desktop_sessions (oauth.desktopSessions.create,\n  pure anonymous) converts the PKCE-bound code into a standard dual-token\n  session honoring the organization chosen in the browser\n- sdkwork-iam-tauri-host: typed desktop browser-login contract (scheme\n  derivation, endpoint paths, bridge names, manifest parity test)\n- new @sdkwork/iam-desktop-auth: PKCE, authorize URL, deep-link callback\n  validation, pending-flow store, session exchange port over the generated\n  SDK, host-port abstraction with browser fallback\n- @sdkwork/auth-pc-react: hosted desktop launch page (/auth/desktop/launch)\n  shown after authorization completion, system-browser login entry +\n  waiting state on the login page, en-US/zh-CN copy\n- new @sdkwork/iam-pc-electron and @sdkwork/iam-pc-tauri host adapters\n  (protocol registration, deepLinks/shellOpen bridge allowlist, renderer\n  host ports)\n- regenerated OpenAPI authorities and the TypeScript app SDK","tree":{"sha":"7699cbb1a2dbb64f31e424a74dce1f6c5e4bea98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/trees/7699cbb1a2dbb64f31e424a74dce1f6c5e4bea98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/git/commits/693efbfa9059648a2bf962d9b13d4470fb0f24ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/693efbfa9059648a2bf962d9b13d4470fb0f24ed","node_id":"C_kwDOTDsd2doAKDY5M2VmYmZhOTA1OTY0OGEyYmY5NjJkOWIxM2Q0NDcwZmIwZjI0ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commit/201b65eeec4fe1adb6d8d42a3f2be6c3ea493d5c","sha":"201b65eeec4fe1adb6d8d42a3f2be6c3ea493d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-iam/commits/201b65eeec4fe1adb6d8d42a3f2be6c3ea493d5c"}],"sha":"693efbfa90596