sers/EijiYoshimura/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EijiYoshimura","id":55535598,"login":"EijiYoshimura","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NTM1NTk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/commits/c13e47cb6c715358784f85d62e2fc3033db0ccb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T02:30:26Z","email":"55535598+EijiYoshimura@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eiji Yoshimura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T02:30:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(HUB-152): client libs de limpeza de leads (purge/delete/deviceId) (#45)\n\nCamada de infra/gateway da Limpeza de Leads (HUB-150/ADR-015), consumida pela UI da\nHUB-153 (ainda não implementada):\n\n- adminLeads.ts: purgeAdminLeads(eventId, secret, deviceId, exportFilename) chama a RPC\n  admin_purge_leads (HUB-151, só-delete). Mesmo padrão de listAdminLeads: checa\n  navigator.onLine antes de chamar, mapeia unauthorized (SQLSTATE 28000), propaga\n  qualquer outro erro (ex.: invalid device id) sem silenciar.\n- leadsDb.ts: deleteLeadsForEvent(eventId) remove do IndexedDB deste dispositivo todos os\n  leads (sincronizados e pendentes) de um evento; listAdminLeads/admin_list_leads\n  permanecem intocados.\n- deviceId.ts (novo): getOrCreateDeviceId() gera um UUID v4 na 1ª chamada e persiste em\n  localStorage, reaproveitado nas seguintes.\n\nTestes cobrem os três caminhos de purgeAdminLeads (purged/unauthorized/offline + erro\ninesperado propagado), o filtro por evento de deleteLeadsForEvent e a persistência de\ngetOrCreateDeviceId.","tree":{"sha":"600725e717b93ffc42e1cf5c89553a957fbde46a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/git/trees/600725e717b93ffc42e1cf5c89553a957fbde46a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/git/commits/c13e47cb6c715358784f85d62e2fc3033db0ccb3","verification":{"payload":"tree 600725e717b93ffc42e1cf5c89553a957fbde46a\nparent f3a5baccaa39604302b94f3b9c4eda2b12e532e4\nauthor Eiji Yoshimura <55535598+EijiYoshimura@users.noreply.github.com> 1783477826 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783477826 -0300\n\nfeat(HUB-152): client libs de limpeza de leads (purge/delete/deviceId) (#45)\n\nCamada de infra/gateway da Limpeza de Leads (HUB-150/ADR-015), consumida pela UI da\nHUB-153 (ainda não implementada):\n\n- adminLeads.ts: purgeAdminLeads(eventId, secret, deviceId, exportFilename) chama a RPC\n  admin_purge_leads (HUB-151, só-delete). Mesmo padrão de listAdminLeads: checa\n  navigator.onLine antes de chamar, mapeia unauthorized (SQLSTATE 28000), propaga\n  qualquer outro erro (ex.: invalid device id) sem silenciar.\n- leadsDb.ts: deleteLeadsForEvent(eventId) remove do IndexedDB deste dispositivo todos os\n  leads (sincronizados e pendentes) de um evento; listAdminLeads/admin_list_leads\n  permanecem intocados.\n- deviceId.ts (novo): getOrCreateDeviceId() gera um UUID v4 na 1ª chamada e persiste em\n  localStorage, reaproveitado nas seguintes.\n\nTestes cobrem os três caminhos de purgeAdminLeads (purged/unauthorized/offline + erro\ninesperado propagado), o filtro por evento de deleteLeadsForEvent e a persistência de\ngetOrCreateDeviceId.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTbZCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjfQQADxxmQVghjGPobbOoVo8fp4s\nlPqjKsfmn28cV463rDp