jiYoshimura","id":55535598,"login":"EijiYoshimura","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NTM1NTk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/commits/6ba3449687dc2113b459fde558ff431b52ba1be6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T19:15:39Z","email":"eiji@eijiyoshimura.com.br","name":"Eiji Yoshimura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T19:15:39Z","email":"eiji@eijiyoshimura.com.br","name":"Eiji Yoshimura"},"message":"fix(HUB-78): suprime teclado nativo Android (readOnly) + caret customizado\n\nSob VK os inputs voltam a readOnly (forma confiável de suprimir o teclado\nnativo no Android, ao contrário de inputMode=\"none\"). O caret nativo some sob\nreadOnly, então o estado de caret passa a viver em React (caretPos) e é\nrenderizado por um CaretOverlay piscante; toque-para-posicionar usa geometria\nde texto medida via canvas (injetável para testes). Remove código morto:\nhandlers de bloqueio nativo (onKeyDown/onBeforeInput/onPaste/onDrop +\nblockNativeTextKey/blockNativeMutation), inputMode=\"none\", a classe\ncaret-[#0333BD] e o remap email->text (que existia só pelo setSelectionRange).\nNúcleo applyKey/keyboardInput permanece puro e inalterado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1f8d9c6d9d6a251818ac7cff5e920e56a0bd9a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/git/trees/d1f8d9c6d9d6a251818ac7cff5e920e56a0bd9a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/git/commits/6ba3