ers/EijiYoshimura/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EijiYoshimura","id":55535598,"login":"EijiYoshimura","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NTM1NTk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/commits/dc78a4b9ad6826f9b30037465ad826b3fb19e033/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T12:52:33Z","email":"eiji@eijiyoshimura.com.br","name":"Eiji Yoshimura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T12:52:33Z","email":"eiji@eijiyoshimura.com.br","name":"Eiji Yoshimura"},"message":"feat(HUB-67): consentimento LGPD no formulário (checkbox + modal de termos, obrigatório)\n\nRemove a ConsentScreen e leva o consentimento para dentro do LeadForm como\ncheckbox de aceite obrigatório + modal de termos sobreposto. Fluxo passa a ser\nsplash → lead-form (sem tela intermediária; sem \"jogar sem participar\").\n\n- lib/lgpd.ts (novo, puro): DEFAULT_CONSENT_VERSION/PURPOSE/RETENTION +\n  buildConsentText(config) (custom → templado → fallback seguro). Testes de\n  template migrados para lib/__tests__/lgpd.test.ts (cobertura preservada).\n- Remove ConsentScreen.tsx + teste (sem código órfão).\n- main.tsx → extraído App.tsx: remove screen ''consent'', handlers e o estado\n  morto leadCaptureEnabled; handleStart → lead-form; consentedAt carimbado no\n  handleLeadSubmit; persistência sempre executada com consentVersion =\n  config.lgpd?.consentVersion ?? DEFAULT_CONSENT_VERSION.\n- LeadForm.tsx: estado accepted (default off) + link \"termos\" que abre o modal;\n  gating dupla camada — ENVIAR disabled sem aceite (fundo accent esmaecido inline,\n  pois disabled:bg-* não vence inline) E bloqueio do submit (Enter) com mensagem\n  aria-live \"É necessário aceitar os termos para participar\" que limpa ao marcar.\n- TermsModal.tsx (novo): role=\"dialog\" + aria-modal + aria-labelledby, focus-trap,\n  fecha por X/Fechar/overlay/Esc, scroll-lock do body, corpo rolável com\n  buildConsentText; Política de Privacidade reusa PrivacyPolicyScreen em camada\n  acima (z-[60] > modal z-50 > teclado virtual). Tema BB.\n- PrivacyPolicyScreen: aria-label do Voltar generalizado.\n- Testes: submit do LeadForm marca o aceite antes (gating); novos testes de\n  checkbox/modal/gating/erro/política; smoke do fluxo splash→lead-form (App).\n\nRegressão zero: teclado virtual (HUB-57/59), validações/máscara, layout HUB-65,\npersistência. Gate verde: eslint 0, tsc 0, vitest 113/113.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24e2ae4160a5aed7cc97e5fbb0cf4a187637b96b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/git/trees/24e2ae4160a5aed7cc97e5fbb0cf4a187637b96b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/git/commits/dc78a4b9ad6826f9b30037465ad826b3fb19e033","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55535598?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EijiYoshimura","id":55535598,"login":"EijiYoshimura","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NTM1NTk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.