nts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EijiYoshimura","id":55535598,"login":"EijiYoshimura","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NTM1NTk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/commits/4da5c668b2d78acf3e3cad4b8ed8785f4ead1b3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T05:16:43Z","email":"eiji@eijiyoshimura.com.br","name":"Eiji Yoshimura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T05:16:43Z","email":"eiji@eijiyoshimura.com.br","name":"Eiji Yoshimura"},"message":"feat(HUB-65): layout do formulário de lead fiel ao mockup + fonte BB\n\nRe-skin visual do LeadForm (camada de apresentação), sem tocar em validação,\nmáscara, onSubmit nem no teclado virtual (HUB-57):\n\n- Fonte oficial Banco do Brasil via @font-face + @theme em src/index.css\n  (3 faces: Titulos-BoldIt labels, Titulos-XBold botão, Textos-Regular inputs);\n  utilitários font-bb-titulos / font-bb-textos. font-display: swap, self-hosted.\n- Novo token event.accentColor? (types.ts, opcional/retrocompatível) e\n  event.accentColor \"#FCFC30\" no config.json; consumido via constante nomeada\n  com fallback (DEFAULT_ACCENT_COLOR). primaryColor mantido (usado em outras telas).\n- Container com moldura branca arredondada alinhada ao board\n  (border-8 border-white rounded-[2.25rem] overflow-hidden), fundo via config.\n- Logo logo_bb.png centralizado no topo (object-contain); título em texto oculto\n  (campo mantido no schema).\n- Labels NOME/EMAIL/TELEFONE: uppercase, brancas, itálico, font-bb-titulos.\n- Inputs pill (rounded-full) brancos, borda accent (border-4), min-h-[56px],\n  font-bb-textos; foco azul visível (ring) substitui o roxo.\n- Botão ENVIAR (substitui \"Jogar\"): pill accent, texto azul #0333BD, font-bb-titulos\n  extra-bold uppercase.\n- A11y: asterisco/erro em vermelho de alto contraste (#FFC7C7); aria-invalid/\n  aria-describedby nos campos com erro.\n- Testes: seletor do botão Jogar -> ENVIAR (3) + 5 testes de layout; teclado\n  virtual e validação seguem verdes (98/98).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4983b93fc6d5d4595eba3f5847554244e8c9eb99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/git/trees/4983b93fc6d5d4595eba3f5847554244e8c9eb99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EijiYoshimura/jogo-memoria/git/commits/4da5c668b2d78acf3e3cad4b8ed8785f4ead1b3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55535598?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EijiYoshimura","id":55535598,"login":"EijiYoshimura","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NTM1NTk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EijiYoshimura/repos","site_a